2 CONC hter of Capt. Abner Howell. Also lived in Washington, County, Pa, Mason County, Ky and Franklin County, In. Member Big Cedar Baptist Church also serving as clerk, he donated part of the property for the church and cemetery. He was
2 CONC  the father of 12 children.
