1 NOTE {geni:about_me} The Life Summary of Alonzo
2 CONT When Alonzo Eddleman was born on 8 July 1871, in Indiana, United States, his father, James Marion Eddleman, was 21 and his mother, Mary Martha Taylor, was 21. He married Frances Folsum Timmons on 1 April 1908, in Indiana, United S
2 CONC tates. They were the parents of at least 3 sons and 3 daughters. He died on 3 July 1952, in Vincennes, Vincennes Township, Knox, Indiana, United States, at the age of 80, and was buried in Fairview Cemetery, Vincennes, Vincennes T
2 CONC ownship, Knox, Indiana, United States.
