1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Daughter of Joel McKinney
2 CONT
2 CONT Mrs.Aaron G.Stout,died at her home in Olney,Illinois,Monday,her remains were brought back her and buried     
2 CONT in South Park Cemt.Her maiden name was Helen McKinney and she was born in Columbus,Ind,Aug.31,1826.     
2 CONT Her father was Joel McKinney who owned both the DeArmond and Sietz House between the years 1835 and      
2 CONT 1845,he also ran the Moss House early in Greensburg history.The Stout family left here in 1866, her husband     
2 CONT died in 1895 in Olney,Illinois,he was the uncle of John W.Stout and T.A Shirk. She leaves a daughter,      
2 CONT Ada E. St.John of Olney and three grandsons, two other daughters died in childhood,Mary and Annette, the     
2 CONT former died at age 2 and the latter died at age 5 years.* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/44714415/helen-stout Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Nov 30 2022, 2:06
