1 NOTE {geni:about_me} George Burch was born in Surry County North Carolina in 1815. When he was eight years old his parents, siblings and some of his half-siblings traveled westward, leaving North Carolina in the autumn of 1823 and arri
2 CONC ving in Greene County IN a few days before Christmas. 
2 CONT
2 CONT George's father, William BURCH, had five brothers and one sister who would eventually come to Indiana with their families. George's mother, Elizabeth RITTER BURCH, had two brothers and a sister who had already made the journey.
2 CONT
2 CONT George married on Christmas Day 1834 to Eliza Ann Christy. He was 19 and she was 17. Eliza had been born in Indiana in 1817, but her parents had come from Rowan Co, North Carolina.
2 CONT
2 CONT George and Eliza raised a large family. According to the 1900 Census Eliza had fourteen children, four of which were alive in June of that year. The following names are 12 of the children attributed to George and Eliza: 
2 CONT
2 CONT Abigail Burch MINKS     1835 – 1880 William BURCH           1838 – 1900 John C BURCH            1839 – 1882 [http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=12448355 Elizabeth Ann Burch BROSMAN]     1844 – 1912 [http://www.f
2 CONC indagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=16845255 Henry A BURCH]           1846 – 1865 [http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=58187405 Ross W (Lawson) BURCH]     1848 – 1929 [http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.c
2 CONC gi?page=gr&GRid=36028345  Levi Preston BURCH]          1851 – 1928 Baby girl BURCH         1854 – 1854 [http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=17180161 Nancy Jane BURCH RITTER]         1856 – 1900 [http://www.findag
2 CONC rave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=57293379 Joseph M BURCH]         1857 – 1926 [http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=16845257 Mary P. BURCH]            1859 – 1889 Eliza M BURCH           1862 – 1864
2 CONT
2 CONT George died Apr 21, 1890 at the age of 75.
2 CONT * Reference: [https://old.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&amp;GRid=16845254 Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Feb 11 2018, 18:07:05 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT George Burch was born in Surry County North Carolina in 1815. When he was eight years old his parents, siblings and some of his half-siblings traveled westward, leaving North Carolina in the autumn of 1823 and arriving in Greene C
2 CONC ounty IN a few days before Christmas. 
2 CONT
2 CONT George's father, William BURCH, had five brothers and one sister who would eventually come to Indiana with their families. George's mother, Elizabeth RITTER BURCH, had two brothers and a sister who had already made the journey.
2 CONT
2 CONT George married on Christmas Day 1834 to Eliza Ann Christy. He was 19 and she was 17. Eliza had been born in Indiana in 1817, but her parents had come from Rowan Co, North Carolina.
2 CONT
2 CONT George and Eliza raised a large family. According to the 1900 Census Eliza had fourteen children, four of which were alive in June of that year. The following names are 12 of the children attributed to George and Eliza: 
