2 CONT * Arabia Brown m. 1778 Elizabeth Dooley (1757-1849).
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Robert Harris''' served as captain of Virginia militia. He was born in Virginia; died, 1806, in Surry County, N. C.
2 CONT
2 CONT William Hiatt (1738-1817) served as private in Col. David Hall's regiment of Foot, Delaware Line. He died in Garrard County, Ky.
2 CONT
2 CONT Arabia Brown (1754-1845) was pensioned, 1833, for service as private in Capt. Charles Watkins's company, Virginia Line. He was born in Virginia; died in Garrard County, Ky.
2 CONT
2 CONT [p.77] Richard Allen (1739-1830) was a private in the 5th Virginia regiment. He was born in Virginia; died in Garrard County, Ky.
2 CONT Also No. 91226.
