1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Children of Robert Harris and Lucretia Brown ==
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Elijah Harris (b. 1762, Albemarle Co., VA); m. Kary Forkner; (Executor; Inherited farm and house).
2 CONT
2 CONT == Biography ==
2 CONT
2 CONT Elijah Harris was born in 1762 in Albemarle County, Virginia. He was the eldest son of Robert Harris (1741–1806) and Lucretia "Lucy" Brown (1746–1806). As a youth, he moved with his parents from the Brown's Cove area of Virginia t
2 CONC o Surry County, North Carolina, during the 1780 migration.
2 CONT
2 CONT Elijah was a primary beneficiary and witness to the family's transition into North Carolina. He is mentioned in the 1806 probate records of his parents and remained active in the local administrative and church records of the regi
2 CONC on.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT == Sources ==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Surry County, North Carolina: Will Book 3, p. 74 (Will of Lucretia Harris, 1806).
