2 CONT * Robert Harris (1741–1806)
2 CONT
2 CONT Half-Siblings (Harris):
2 CONT * Elijah Harris (b. 1762); m. Elizabeth Early.
2 CONT * Nancy Harris (b. 1763); m. William Thompson.
2 CONT * Mourning Birch Harris (b. 1764); m. William Jouett.
2 CONT * Tyree Rhodes Harris (b. 1765); m. Mary Ann Hunt.
2 CONT * Sarah Harris (b. c. 1767); m. James Harrison.
2 CONT * Bernice Harris (b. c. 1769); m. Henrietta Rodes.
