1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Birth:  1712 Sumiswald Verwaltungskreis Emmental Bern, Switzerland  Death:  1770 Hempfield Lancaster County Pennsylvania, USA 
2 CONT
2 CONT Exact Burial Location https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/137059827/joseph-schurgh-sherck
2 CONT
2 CONT aka: Scherch, Schurch, Sherck, Sherk, Sherrick etc
2 CONT
2 CONT Joseph was a Swiss Palatine Immigrant Father, Mennonite Minister Ulrich Shirk I,  and family arrived Aug 24,1728  in Philadelphia on ship "Motonhouse" 
2 CONT
2 CONT Married to Catherine Furry (dau of John Furry-Swiss Immigrant)
2 CONT
2 CONT Joseph settled in West Hempfield Twp, Lancaster County PA
2 CONT
2 CONT *Children of Joseph & Catherine:  Joseph 1734-1807 Jacob 1735-1788 Maria 1737-1814 (m.Christian Erb) John 1738-ca.1783 Magdalena 1740-1765(m.Jacob Strickler) Barbara 1742-1770 (m.Christian Martin) poss Catherine b.1739  .
2 CONT *Memorial Headstone for Immigrant
2 CONT  Ulrich Shirk & Family, located
2 CONT  at Steinmetz Cemetery in
2 CONT  Schoeneck, Lancaster Co, PA 
2 CONT
2 CONT Family links: 
2 CONT  Children:
2 CONT   Joseph Sherrick (1734 - 1807)*
2 CONT   Maria Scherch Erb (1737 - 1814)*
2 CONT
2 CONT *Calculated relationship
2 CONT
2 CONT Inscription: In memory of ULRICH SHIRK who came from Switzerland on ship Motonhouse and landed  at Phila Aug 24,1728 with family of 8 children, 6 sons & 2 daughters. Viz: Ulrich,John,Caspar,Peter,Michael,Joseph and Martha, Jeanett
2 CONC e (Balance is UlrichII bio,re Memorial#62261951)
2 CONT *At Steinmetz Cemetery, Schoeneck,Lancaster,PA
2 CONT
2 CONT Note: Joseph's burial location is unknown https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/137059827/joseph-schurgh-sherck
2 CONT
