1 NAME Susannah /Curle/
2 GIVN Susannah
2 SURN Curle
2 _MARNM Gregg
1 SEX F
1 BURI
2 PLAC Kennett Square, Chester County, Pennsylvania, United States of America
2 ADDR
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1716
2 PLAC New Castle, New Castle County, Delaware, United States of America
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE 23 OCT 1764
2 PLAC Kennett Square, Chester County, Pennsylvania, United States of America
2 ADDR
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/141537280/susanna-gregg
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of John Gregg, daughter of  Richard & Mary Curle∼Susannah  married John Gregg  8mon/Oct 13/1737 at the New Garden Meeting, New Castle, Delaware.
2 CONT
2 CONT John and Susanna Gregg were the parents of 9 children: Amos, Amy, Hannah, Mary, George, John, Richard, Lydia, and Rebecca.
2 CONT
2 CONT According to the "Encyclopedia of American Quaker Genealogy," page 496, Susannah died 23 Oct 1764 and was the mother of 9 Children, 8 of whom came with their father, John Gregg, to Fairfax Monthly Meeting, VA in 1766, except for A
2 CONC mos, who came a year previously, all with certificates from Kennett Monthly Meeting, PA.* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/141537280/susanna-gregg Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18
2 CONC 783 SmartCopy]: ''Jan 25 2024, 22:12:10 UTC''
