2 CONT Brief Life History of Hannah
2 CONT
2 CONT When Hannah Gregg was born on 8 March 1740, in Chester, Pennsylvania, British Colonial America, her father, John Gregg, was 23 and her mother, Susanna Curle, was 22. She married Caleb Dixon on 23 July 1761, in Wilmington, New Cast
2 CONC le, Delaware, United States. They were the parents of at least 3 sons and 7 daughters. She died about 1789, in Chatham, North Carolina, United States, at the age of 50, and was buried in Chatham, North Carolina, United States.
