2 CONC age Family Trees] via daughter [http://www.geni.com/profile/index/6000000033212791019 Rachel Elizabeth Farnsworth (born Stout)] by [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Apr 28 2015, 18:15:32 UTC''
2 CONT
