1 NAME Marie /Stuart/
2 GIVN Marie
2 SURN Stuart
2 _MARNM Edwards
1 SEX F
1 BURI
2 PLAC Mount Hope Cemetery, Peru, Miami County, Indiana, USA
2 ADDR
1 BIRT
