1 NAME Albert Eli /Snow/
2 GIVN Albert Eli
2 SURN Snow
2 _MARNM Snow
1 SEX M
1 BURI
2 PLAC Dobbs Valley Cemetery, New Salem, Palo Pinto County, Texas, USA
2 ADDR
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1852
