1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Joel Burch was born in Stokes Co, NC to John Lawrence BURCH and Judith (SOUTHERN) Burch. He was the sixth of nine children and the third of five sons. He came with his extended family to Monroe County Indiana in 18
2 CONC 19 when he was seven years old. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Joel's father, John Lawrence BURCH, was a farmer. Joel and all his brothers became farmers as well.
2 CONT
2 CONT Joel married 4 Nov 1841 in Greene Co, Indiana, when he was 29. His wife, Matilda Burch, was a second cousin, ten years his junior. Together the couple had three children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT William Burch       1842 – 1901 Hiram Burch         1843 – 1930 Mary Ann Burch      1850 – 1897
2 CONT
2 CONT Joel lived to be seventy-one years old and died in Monroe Co. Oct 4 1883.* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/20425022/joel-burch Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''F
2 CONC eb 20 2021, 21:52:34 UTC''
