1 NAME Martha /Lawrence/
2 GIVN Martha
2 SURN Lawrence
2 _MARNM Burch
2 NICK Mourning
2 NICK Moura
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 27 MAY 1779
2 PLAC North Carolina, United States
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE 7 NOV 1868
2 PLAC Beech Creek, Greene, Indiana, United States
2 ADDR
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} My confusion is with the wife and mother of his children.
2 CONT
2 CONT >> You have a Martha Lawrence (daughter of a Lawrence and Isabella Ross). 
2 CONT
2 CONT >>Other people have a Martha Beasley (daughter of a Beasley). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Are you familiar with this conflicting research? Can you tell me why Lawrence (and, maybe why not Beasley)? I'm a little suspicious about the Lawrence as there is clear documentation that George's mother is Mary Ann Lawrence. Appr
2 CONC eciate any help you can give..
2 CONT
2 CONT From: Elizabeth T..
2 CONT >Yes I'm familiar with this conflict. I have at different times used both maiden names for Martha. 
2 CONT
2 CONT >>There isn't a lot of documentation to prove it either way.''' However, I am told that there are Bible records that record George and Martha's marriage date, give her maiden name as Lawrence and record her parent's names.''' Now 
2 CONC of course I've not seen the Bible so the claim might be false, but I don't have anything to prove she's a Beasley either.
2 CONT
2 CONT >You may not have noticed, '''but there is another Martha Beasley in the Burch family tree and I think this might be where the confusion came in.''' Martha Beasley is the mother of Locky Collins, who is the wife of Davis Burch. Th
2 CONC e two Marthas are contemporaries: George's wife is 1779-1868, Locky's mother is 1790-1850. However, to my knowledge, Locky's mother never came to Indiana, and George's wife is definitely buried in Burch Cemetery in Greene Co IN..
2 CONT
2 CONT >Now I understand your suspicions. I think it's healthy to be suspicious based on Bible records someone claims to have but doesn't show. But unfortunately at the moment I have nothing better. As for George's mother being a Lawrenc
2 CONC e, I wouldn't let that bother you. Given the Burch habit of inbreeding I might be more likely to believe it. I am personally the direct descendant of both George and two of his brothers. Once you get over that you're willing to ac
2 CONC cept a few repeated surnames.
2 CONT
2 CONT In her husbands  [http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=5137053&ref=acom&ftm=1 From Find-a-Grave] she is listed as:
2 CONT
2 CONT >Married on 13 Oct 1789 or 1799 in Surry County, North Carolina, Martha "Mourning Moura" LAWRENCE 1779 – 1868 
2 CONT
2 CONT In her [http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=5137094 find-a-grave] she is given as:
2 CONT >Birth:  May 27, 1779 Richmond Henrico County Virginia, USA 
2 CONT
2 CONT >Death:  Nov. 6, 1868 Greene County Indiana, USA 
2 CONT
2 CONT >Martha, wife of George Burch, Sr., married Oct 13 1799; mother of Davis Burch
2 CONT
2 CONT >According to the Burch family bible, she is Martha Lawrence. "The Burch bible says Martha's father is Richard and has her mother listed as Isabella Cherokee Indian Ross, the bible is in possession of M. H. Kent in La Crescenta, C
2 CONC alif. " per ancestry member "Ronald Burch". Martha's mother was the second wife of Richard.
2 CONT
2 CONT >[Also thanks to her Grt Grt Grt Grandaughter for clarification]; possibly born May 16, 1780 in North Carolina 
2 CONT
2 CONT This is taken from my book, “Footsteps From Baronshill,” which documents the Collings family from England to the US, from 1600’s to 1900’s. Jackie Foster
2 CONT
2 CONT  >George Sr Burch b. 14 Oct 1777, Stokes County, NC, d. 17 Jun 1862, Greene CO, IN, buried Jun 1862 Burch Cemetery, Beech CREEK TWP, Greene Co. IN.
2 CONT
2 CONT > BIOGRAPHY: Records from Burch Family Bible in possession of Mae H. Kent (decs.) La Crescenta, Calif. From Cora S. Winkler to Edw. E. Burch George m. Martha Lawrence, daughter of Richard Lawrence and Isabella (Cherokee Indian) Ro
2 CONC ss, 13 Oct 1799, Surry County, NC. Martha b. 27 May 1779, NC, d. 7 Nov 1868, Greene Co., IN, buried Nov 1868 in Beech CREEK TWP. Wedding date from Bible records. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Previously connected:
2 CONT * https://www.geni.com/people/Martha/6000000074178373019
