2 CONT * Richmond, Henrico, Virginia, USA
2 CONT * Immediate Family:	
2 CONT * Daughter of 
2 CONT * https://www.geni.com/people/John-Beasley/6000000012507511320; & https://www.geni.com/people/Eliabeth-Beasley/6000000012507565314 and 
2 CONT * richard lawrence; & isabella ross 
2 CONT * ? Lawrence {NOTE: merged in with Richard Lawrence}; 
2 CONT
2 CONT ===================================
2 CONT
