2 CONT >Here's something interesting, [http://cookmanfinkgeneology.blogspot.com/2011/02/how-long-my-family-has-been-in-indiana_21.html this tree] lists an Isaac Forkner b. 1775 Surry Co., NC as marrying a Mourning Moura Lawrence in 1797 
