1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Jane was born in Surrey Co NC, the daughter of George Burch and Martha Lawrence. When Jane was in her early teens, her parents and most of her extended family moved to Greene Co IN. When she was 16, Jane married to
2 CONC  Peter Lunsford Storm on Jan 23, 1823. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Jane and Peter had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Preston STORM (1823 – ) Elizabeth Storm (1832 – 1865) James B Storm (1833 – 1903) Isaac Storm (1836 – ) William D Storm (1838 – 1865) George Washington Storm (1841 – 1903) Peter Lunsford, Jr. Storm (1843 – 1900) Susanna "Susan" L.
2 CONC  STORM (1844 – 1912) John J Storm (1846 – ) Jefferson H Storm (1848 – )
2 CONT
2 CONT During the 1850s Jane and Peter moved their family to  Jasper County Missouri, but the Civil War took a tragic tole.  Jane's husband Peter and son William were killed by federal sympathizers. Jane returned to Indiana sometime afte
2 CONC r 1870 and died there in 1883. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Bio written by Beth Hagan* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/53381595/jane-storm Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Feb 20 2021, 21:54:26 UTC''
