1 NOTE {geni:about_me} She has been mistaken for https://www.geni.com/people/Martha-Burch/6000000010411919216  see full information  about   her under he profile.
2 CONT
2 CONT IF this Martha Besley exist  here is a explanation  taken from  https://www.geni.com/people/Martha-Burch/6000000010411919216  about me:
2 CONT
2 CONT >You may not have noticed, '''but there is another Martha Beasley in the Burch family tree and I think this might be where the confusion came in.''' Martha Beasley is the mother of Locky Collins, who is the wife of Davis Burch. Th
2 CONC e two Marthas are contemporaries: George's wife is 1779-1868, Locky's mother is 1790-1850. However, to my knowledge, Locky's mother never came to Indiana, and George's wife is definitely buried in Burch Cemetery in Greene Co IN..
2 CONT
