2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT About 1825 Mary and James moved from North Carolina to Greene county, Indiana. This was probably because James' father and siblings had moved there about 1816. Many of James and Mary's children continued the migration west settlin
2 CONC g in the Page County, IA and Nodaway County, MO area. Some of the Spargers that were living in Highland County, OH also ended up in the same places and they were probably staying in touch. JWA
2 CONT
