2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth SUTHERLAND married Charles BURCH in Surry County, North Carolina on 20 Aug 1802. The couple raised a large family:
2 CONT
2 CONT Charles BURCH 1803 –
2 CONT William BURCH 1805 –
2 CONT Anna BURCH 1806 –
2 CONT Martha BURCH 1808 – 1898
2 CONT James Southern BURCH 1809 – 1864
2 CONT Mary BURCH 1813 – 1890
2 CONT Winston BURCH 1815 – 1880
2 CONT Fuel BURCH 1817 – 1906
2 CONT Benjamin BURCH 1823 – 1859
2 CONT Perlina BURCH 1824 – 1893
2 CONT Charles BURCH 1825 –
2 CONT William BURCH 1827 –
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth and Charles moved to Greene County Indiana sometime after the birth of their last child and before the 1830 census. They remained in Greene County the rest of their lives.
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth died 4 Apr 1858 at the age of 76 years, 7 months, 29 days.
2 CONT
2 CONT *******************************************************
2 CONT Notes:
2 CONT There has been some suggestion that Elizabeth's maiden name was SOUTHERN rather than SUTHERLAND. I have been unable to prove either name positively.
2 CONT
2 CONT I have two sets of birth dates for her sons, Charles and William. I include both until I know which ones are correct.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Inscription
2 CONT ELIZABETH wife of CHARLES BURCH Died April 9, 1858 Aged 76 Yrs, 7 M, 29 D
