1 NAME Robert /Harris/
2 GIVN Robert
2 SURN Harris
2 _MARNM Harris
2 NICK Overton
2 NICK Robert
2 NICK Harris
1 NAME Major Robert Harris, of Albemarle County
1 SEX M
1 BURI
2 ADDR
3 STAE Virginia
1 BIRT
2 DATE 10 NOV 1696
2 ADDR
3 CITY St. Peters Parish
3 STAE Virginia
1 DEAT
