2 CONT
2 CONT John Dabney married Anna Harris about 1739/40. She was a daughter of Major Robert and Mourning (Glenn) Harris of Albemarle County, Virginia. John and Anna had 11 children: Sarah, born 1746; Mary; William, born abt 1748; John, born
2 CONC  May 3, 1749; Anna; Elizabeth; Susan; Lucy; Rebecca; Cornelius; and Nancy.
2 CONT
