2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.ancestry.com/family-tree/person/tree/111701831/person/432242652581 Ancestry Genealogy] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Dec 13 2020, 23:40:13 UTC''
2 CONT
