2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT William Harris, born March 15, 1752, son of https://www.geni.com/people/Major-Robert-Harris-of-Albemarle-County/6000000003073335079?through=6000000003073165865 & https://www.geni.com/people/Mourning-Harris/6000000003073165865?thro
