2 CONT * William "Billy" Brown (1735–1780); m. Sarah Jennings. He was a son of Benjamin Brown and Miss Wilson.
2 CONT * Benjamin Brown, Jr. (c. 1737–1781); m. Susannah Jarman. He was a son of Benjamin Brown and Miss Wilson.
2 CONT * Elizabeth Brown (c. 1740); m. John Price. She was a daughter of Benjamin Brown and Miss Wilson.
2 CONT * Agnes Brown (c. 1741–1831). She was a daughter of Benjamin Brown and Miss Wilson.
2 CONT * Lucinda Brown (c. 1742). She was a daughter of Benjamin Brown and Miss Wilson.
2 CONT * Elizabeth Brown (1744–bef. 1762); m. John Price. She was a daughter of Benjamin Brown and Sarah Thompson.
2 CONT * Lucretia "Lucy" Brown (1746–1806); m1. Bezaleel Brown; m2. Robert Harris. She was a daughter of Benjamin Brown and Sarah Thompson.
2 CONT * William Brown (1747–1836). He was a son of Benjamin Brown and Sarah Thompson.
2 CONT * Barzillai Brown (1747–c. 1813). He was a son of Benjamin Brown and Sarah Thompson.
2 CONT * Benajah Brown (1748–1814); m. Mary Jarman. He was a son of Benjamin Brown and Sarah Thompson.
2 CONT * Bernard Brown (1750–1800); m. Elizabeth Jennings Dabney. He was a son of Benjamin Brown and Sarah Thompson.
2 CONT * Bernis Brown (1752–1814); m. Henrietta Rodes. He was a son of Benjamin Brown and Sarah Thompson.
2 CONT * Bezaleel Brown (1754–1829); m. Mary "Polly" Thompson. He was a son of Benjamin Brown and Sarah Thompson.
2 CONT * Brightberry Brown (1762–1846); m. Susan Deer. He was a son of Benjamin Brown and Sarah Thompson.
2 CONT
