1 NAME David /Blackwell/
2 GIVN David
2 SURN Blackwell
2 _MARNM Blackwell
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 27 NOV 1755
2 ADDR
3 STAE Virginia
1 DEAT
2 DATE 25 JUN 1841
2 ADDR
3 STAE Virginia
3 CTRY United States
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Revolutionary War pensioner, per 1840 Tennessee - Eastern District Census of Parishioners, June 1, 1840. He was 82 at the age of last pension census, listed under Roane County.
2 CONT
2 CONT In the 1810 Prince William VA census, there is a David Blackwell listed with one male under 10, two males 10-16, one 26-45, and one over 45. One female under 10, two females 10-16, one female over 45.
2 CONT
2 CONT The same David Blackwell is listed in the 1820 Prince William VA census as follows: three males under 10, one over 45; one female under 10, one female 45 and up.
2 CONT
2 CONT He is listed in the 1830 Roane, TN census, one male 5-10, one male 70-80 (David), one female 20-30, one female 60-70.
2 CONT
2 CONT Also listed in the 1840 Roane, TN census as a Revolutionary War pensioner, aged 82, farming. One dependent female (a daughter?) aged 30-40. (The boy has probably married and moved on - not listed on the same page, possibly has a d
2 CONC ifferent last name)
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT * Reference: '''Blackwell Family''' (Continued) Stella Pickett Hardy. ''The Virginia Magazine of History and Biography'', Jan., 1915, Vol. 23, No. 1, pp. 101-103 Published by: Virginia Historical Society
2 CONT 5em>Stable URL: https://www.jstor.org/stable/4243414
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
