0 @I6000000027952488517@ INDI
1 NAME Nancy /Blackwell/
2 GIVN Nancy
2 SURN Blackwell
2 _MARNM Sublett
2 NICK Nancy Harris
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1779
2 ADDR
3 STAE Virginia
3 CTRY United States
1 DEAT
2 DATE 13 NOV 1852
2 ADDR
3 STAE Kentucky
3 CTRY United States
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Married William Sublett April 24, 1806, Garrard County Kentucky
2 CONT
2 CONT Some sources say she is a Harris, not a Blackwell. Either of those should be verified. The Sublett histories all record her as 'Mrs. Nancy Harris', so she must have been a widow, who married William Sublett after her husband passe
2 CONC d, giving more credence to the Blackwell parentage.
2 CONT
2 CONT Another genealogist - Donald J. Sublette, of 17351 Appoline, Detroit, MI 48235, has named her as 'Nancy Garland Harris Sublett', on which authority is not known. His dates show Wm. Sublett 1760-1818, Ruth Ford, 1765-1805, Nancy Ga
2 CONC rland Harris, 1780-1852. All born VA, all died Madison -Garrard Cos. KY.
2 CONT
2 CONT References cited in which Nancy Harris Sublett is mentioned:  The Sublett (Soblet) Family of Manakintown, King William Parish, Virginia; Cameron Allen, 2008. Generations Remembered: Sublette Family 1700-1850, by Nancy Louise Suble
2 CONC tte
