2 TITL Ancestry Family Trees
1 NOTE !SOURCES:
2 CONT     1. From Ancestral File (TM), data as of 2 January 1996.
2 CONT     2. 1997 Ordinance Index
2 CONT     3. Main Archives - nil
2 CONT     4. 2000 Ordinance Index
1 NOTE http://www.esva.net/ghotes/lank/i0000243.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT  William1 Riche {Planter} was born in of Surrey, or Essex Co., England about 1620/1637. William died 1685 in Taylors ridge, island creek, Talbot Co., Maryland, at 64 years of age. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Alice Paddison MRS in of Talbot Co., Maryland, about 1659. Alice was born in of, Gloucester Co., Virginia about 1631. Alice died May 15, 1692 in Taylors ridge, island creek, Talbot Co., Maryland, at 60 years of age. Ali
2 CONC ce was baptized a member of The Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints May 7, 1934. Temple Code: MANTI. Alice and William Riche Planter were sealed October 19, 1993. Temple Code: SLAKE. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He was christened in of, Gloucester Co., VA. William was baptized a member of The Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints October 7, 1993. Temple Code: SLAKE. William and Alice Paddison MRS were sealed October 19, 1993. Temple
2 CONC  Code: SLAKE. He was endowed February 19, 1994. Temple Code: SLAKE. Virginia historical magazine page 93 vol 28 
2 CONT
2 CONT William Riche Planter and Alice Paddison MRS had the following children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT  2 i. Katherine2 Riche was born in Talbot Co, MD about 1660. She married John Burgess in Talbot Co., MD, about 1684. John was born in Talbot Co, MD about 1660. John was baptized a member of The Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day
2 CONC  Saints. Temple Code: NAME. He was endowed. Temple Code: NAME. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Katherine was baptized a member of The Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints. Temple Code: NAME. She was endowed. Temple Code: NAME. She was sealed to her parents. Temple Code: NAME. 
2 CONT
2 CONT  3 ii. Eve Rich was born in Talbot, Maryland about 1660. Eve died 1724 in Talbot Co., MD, at 64 years of age. She married twice. She married Thomas Delahay in old Whitemarsh, Talbot Co., Maryland, July 9, 1681. Thomas was born in 
2 CONC N. Sheilds, England, or Charles co., Maryland about 1661. Thomas was the son of William Delahay. Thomas died February 10, 1699 in island creek, Talbot Co., Maryland, at 37 years of age. Thomas was baptized a member of The Church o
2 CONC f Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints May 5, 1934. Temple Code: SLAKE. Thomas and Eve Rich were sealed May 24, 1991. Temple Code: PROVO. He was sealed to his parents July 18, 1995. Temple Code: BOUNT. (See Thomas Delahay for the con
2 CONC tinuation of this line.) She married Richard Holmes in Talbot Co., Maryland, September 21, 1703. Richard was born in Talbot Co., MD about 1675. Richard was baptized a member of The Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints. Temp
2 CONC le Code: NAME. He was endowed. Temple Code: NAME. Richard and Eve Rich were sealed January 25, 1979. Temple Code: SLAKE. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Eve and Richard Holmes were sealed January 25, 1979. Temple Code: SLAKE. Eve and Thomas Delahay were sealed May 24, 1991. Temple Code: PROVO. Eve was baptized a member of The Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints February 8,
2 CONC  1994. Temple Code: SLAKE. She was endowed June 23, 1994. Temple Code: SLAKE. She was sealed to her parents July 19, 1994. Temple Code: SLAKE. 
2 CONT
2 CONT  + 4 iii. William Rich was born about 1662. 
2 CONT
2 CONT  5 iv. Elizabeth Rich was born in Talbot, Maryland about 1663. She married John Blower in Talbot Co., MD, about 1688. John was born in Talbot Co, MD about 1660. John was baptized a member of The Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-da
2 CONC y Saints. Temple Code: NAME. He was endowed. Temple Code: NAME. 
2 CONT
2 CONT  6 v. Ann Rich was born in Talbot, Maryland about 1666. She married Peter Watts in of Talbot Co., Maryland, about 1690. Peter was born in Talbot, Maryland about 1658. Peter was baptized a member of The Church of Jesus Christ of La
2 CONC tter-day Saints May 5, 1934. Temple Code: SLAKE. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Ann was baptized a member of The Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints February 8, 1994. Temple Code: SLAKE. She was endowed June 23, 1994. Temple Code: SLAKE. She was sealed to her parents July 19, 1994. Temple Code: SLAKE.
2 CONC
2 CONT
2 CONT  7 vi. Mary Rich was born in Talbot, Maryland about 1667. She married Francis Harrison. Francis was born in island creek, Talbot Co, MD 1648. Francis died 1711 at 63 years of age. Francis was baptized a member of The Church of Jes
2 CONC us Christ of Latter-day Saints May 5, 1934. Temple Code: SLAKE. (See Francis Harrison for the continuation of this line.) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary was baptized a member of The Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints February 8, 1994. Temple Code: SLAKE. She was endowed June 23, 1994. Temple Code: SLAKE. She was sealed to her parents July 19, 1994. Temple Code: SLAKE
2 CONC . 
2 CONT
2 CONT  8 vii. Sarah Riche was born in Talbot, Maryland about 1674. She married John Mullikin Attorney in Talbot Co., MD, about 1698. John was born in Talbot Co., MD about 1652. John died 1736 in of Readley, Talbot Co., MD, at 84 years o
2 CONC f age. John was baptized a member of The Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints June 29, 1965. Temple Code: IFALL. He was endowed December 10, 1965. Temple Code: IFALL. (See John Mullikin Attorney for the continuation of this
2 CONC  line.) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah was baptized a member of The Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints February 8, 1994. Temple Code: SLAKE. She was endowed June 23, 1994. Temple Code: SLAKE. She was sealed to her parents July 19, 1994. Temple Code: SLAK
2 CONC E.
2 CONT
