2 CONT 15 Oct 1684 Talbot county land records. William RICH Planter and Alice his wife to Thomas DELAHAY Planter Wedding gift to their daughter Eve 100 acres, part of Taylors Ridge at the head of St micheals creek Alice RICH examined bef
2 CONC ore Edward MAN and William COMBS (Combs Researcher Ray Mont who adds that Alice was nee PATTISON). See also below re Delahay and Pattison.
