2 CONT Died before 18 Aug 1783 before age 67 in Truro, Barnstable, Massachusetts, United States 
2 CONT
2 CONT Family Tree of Joseph Rich
2 CONT
2 CONT JOSEPH
2 CONT
2 CONT Joseph Rich
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of Richard Rich and Anne (Unknown) Rich
2 CONT
2 CONT Brother of Sarah (Rich) Remick, Richard Rich, Rebecca (Rich) Brown, Zaccheus Rich, Obadiah Rich, Priscilla Rich, Huldah (Rich) Harding and Sylvanus Rich
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Susanna (Collins) Rich — married 2 Mar 1742 in Truro, Barnstable, Massachusetts  
2 CONT
