1 NOTE {geni:about_me} aria's name is on a memorial marker at the Wenger Meeting House Cemetery in Jonestown, Pennsylvania. There is an asterisk by her name- which means that she is actually believed to be buried there.
2 CONT
2 CONT Maria was the daughter of Johannes 'Hans' Wenger and Anna Shirk/Sherrick/ Shirrock. The family of ten immigrated to Philadelphia together on September 16,1748 aboard the ship Patience.
2 CONT
2 CONT Maria was unmarried. Her will was probated April 13, 1775. Probate was at Lancaster in Will Book of Y-2-74. She mentions her sisters and brothers and leaves her clothes to the female children of her sibling Judith, John and Christ
2 CONC ian. 
