2 CONT MICHAEL SHERK (16 Aug 1815-13 Dec 1867) d accident in his store [still extant]in Grantville, East Hanover Twp, Dauphin Co., PA see obit in 2 EGS Sherk Bibles; par Jacob Sherk & Katherine [Catharine] Bruss/Bross (brother: Henry B. 
2 CONC Sherk* {24 May 1823 - 23 Nov 1906} m Mary C. (Maria) Swope {20 Apr 1827?-31 July 1898?} , m (19 Dec 1839) Elizabeth Gloninger Swope (20 Feb 1822- 17 May 1900) par Christian Schwob/Swobe/Swope & Ann Maria/Mary Gloninger; bur U.B. C
2 CONC em, Grantville, East Hanover Twp, Dauphin Co. PA; liv Grantville PA; had 6/7? children 1 John Henry, Dr. (24 Feb 1841-24 May 1870) d Germantown, PA. liv Philadelphia, see obit in EGS Sherk Bible, m 1 (20 Dec 1859) Emma D. Humphrie
2 CONC s/Humphrie (1840-14 Mar 1866) dau of Francis Humphreys fide obit in EGS Sherk Bible had 2 children 1 Bessie H. Sherk (1 June 1862-) b Philadelphia, PA 2 Henry H. Sherk (1862/66-1927?) d Pasadena, CA m 2 Maggie R. Humphries 2 CATHE
2 CONC RINE "KATE" GLONINGER (22 Feb 1843-22 Oct 1922) b Hanover, Lebanon Co. PA, d NYC?; bur HC:B-2:183:4* m (20 Apr 1875) Henry Charles Orth (8 Apr 1843- 30 Sep 1916) his par: John Orth and Margaret Elizabeth Ruffer/Rufer/Rüfer b & d H
2 CONC arrisburg, PA, had 1 child 1 FLORENCE GLONINGER ORTH (15 Jan 1876-17 Feb 1970) b Harrisburg, PA d NYC; m (17 Apr 1900) Robert McKelvy (6 Aug 1875- 9 Dec 1937) 3 Jacob Swobe (30 June 1844-) E. Hanover Twp, Lebanon Co., PA m (14 Feb
2 CONC  1867) Emma R. Early, had 5 children born 1867-1880, 4 Emma Matilda (8 Jan 1848-24 Jan 1849) 5 Mary Elizabeth (4 Jly 1840/49-6 Mar 1916) b Grantville PA, liv & d Harrisburg PA bur HC:B:6:1*, m Henry Uhler (abt 1851-13 Jan 1901) pa
2 CONC r Frederick & Elizabeth Uhler bur HC:B:6:2* , no(?) children 6 Galen M. (abt 25 May 1856-14 Oct 1861) d diph. age 5y8m20d in Mechanicsville, Dauphin Co. PA fide obit in EGS Sherk Bible) 7 Laura L. (24 Dec 1861-abt 1939) b Lebanon 
2 CONC Co., PA, d Camp Hill, PA [oddly, not officially listed as child but found in photo album and marriage clipping in EGS Sherk large Bible, but not in handwritten list of EGSS children; also her birth was when mother, Katherine, was 
