2 CONT Sampson Sr. was born in 1718. Sampson Howell Sr...  He passed away in 1803.  Brief bio & photos of his home & workers in the environs were submitted to Image by Rob Howell. Two sons: William and Garrett emigrated to Canada, as the
2 CONC y were Loyalists.  See their personal profiles for further info.  Check Janel Howell's book for complete info. For further info, see Source material, as well as that scanned (attached to his profile "Photos") and commentary by Rob
2 CONC  Howell in unpublished book on his descendancy from Hugh and Sampson. Thanks to  Rob Howell for starting this profile. Click the Changes tab for the details of contributions by Rob and others.
2 CONT
