1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Elizabeth Catherine Manning Howk, wife of Salathiel Lacy Howk "Houk" (buried Union Cemetery, Jackson Co. AL.
2 CONT
2 CONT For his wife he married Elizabeth, a daughter of Moses Maples, whose wife was Catherine Manning. Mrs. Howk was born July 14, 1827, and died near Wolf City, Texas, November 12, 1898. The issue of their marriage were: Andrew J., of 
2 CONC this notice; Lydia, who married John Hodges and died in Alabama; Wiliam M., of Grapevine, Texas; Moses, of Denton, Texas; Mary, deceased, married F. M. Nelson, of Bowie; Martha, who married Henry Wells, both died near Lewisville, 
2 CONC Texas; Frank G. of Commerce, Texas; Thomas, who died near Guerdon, Texas; Sidney J., of Wolf City, Texas; Etoy L., who married F. M. Nelson and died near Wolf City; and the remainder of the family of sixteen died in childhood.
2 CONT --------------------
