2 CONT
2 CONT 2.  Sarah STOUT (b. 10 Sep 1689) m. Andrew SMITH. (our line)
2 CONT
2 CONT 3.  Benjamin STOUT (b. 14 Dec 1691) m. Hannah BONHAM.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4.  Hannah STOUT (b. 29 Mar 1694) m. Jediah HIGGINS.
2 CONT
2 CONT 5.  Zebulon STOUT (b. 1699, d. 27 Aug 1788, Hopewell, Hunterdon Co., NJ) m. Charity BURROWS (b. 1702, d. 1772), daug. of Thomas BURROWS.
