2 CONT ii. Joseph STOUT unlikely was born 25 Oct 1686 in Middletown, , , NJ, and died 22 Oct 1766 in Hopewell, Hunterdon, Co, NJ. He married Ruth GREENLAND 10 Oct 1705 in Hopewell, Monmouth, Co, NJ. She was born ABT 1688 in , Monmouth, C
2 CONC o, NJ.
2 CONT
2 CONT iii. Sarah STOUT was born 10 Sep 1689 also 9 Oct 1689 in Middleton, Monmouth, Co, NJ, and died 24 Apr 1767. She married Andrew SMITH. He was born ABT 1690 in of Hunterdon Co. NJ.
