2 CONT iv. Benjamin STOUT was born 14 Dec 1691 in Hopewell, Hunterdon Co., NJ, and died 2 Feb 1751/1752 in Hopewell, Hunterdon Co. NJ. He married Hannah BONHAM ABT 1714 in of, , , NJ, daughter of Hezekiah BONHAM and MARY DUNN. She was bo
2 CONC rn 14 Mar 1694/1695 in Piscataway, NJ, and died 21 Jan 1770 in Hopewell, Hunterdon, Co, NJ.
