2 CONC 1771 in at, Hopewell.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. vii. Jonathan STOUT was born 1701 in Hopewell, Hunterdon, Co, NJ, and died 1768. He married Mary LEIGH ABT 1732. She was born ABT 1706 in of, Hopewell, , NJ, and died 1776 in Hopewell, Hunterdon Co., NJ,.
2 CONT
2 CONT viii. Anne STOUT was born 1704 in Hopewell, Hunterdon, Co, NJ.
2 CONT
