2 CONC opewell, , NJ, and died 30 Apr 1791 in Hunterdon Co., NJ. He married Catherine SIMPSON 1729 in of, , Monmouth, NJ. She was born 1692 in of, Monmouth, , NJ, and died 8 Dec 1749 in Hopewell, Hunterdon, Co NJ.
