1 NOTE {geni:about_me} iii. Sarah STOUT was born 10 Sep 1689 also 9 Oct 1689 in Middleton, Monmouth, Co, NJ, and died 24 Apr 1767. She married Andrew SMITH. He was born ABT 1690 in of Hunterdon Co. NJ.
2 CONT
2 CONT md. before September 4, 1709 (birth of first child), SARAH STOUT, b. September 10, 1689 Middletown, Monmouth County, NJ [First Town Book of Middletown, New Jersey, p. 71], d. July 12, 1761 Hopewell, Hunterdon (Mercer) County, NJ [
2 CONC Samuel Stout Bible, Hopewell Museum], daughter of JONATHAN STOUT and ANNA BOLLEN. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Andrew Smith and his wife Sarah are buried at the Hunt Farm Burial Ground, Harbourton-Woodsville Road, Hopewell Township, Mercer County, NJ.
2 CONT
2 CONT Andrew and Sarah had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT # Andrew Smith b 4 SEP 1709 Hopewell, Mercer, NJ  d 20 MAR 1794 m Ann Mershon   
2 CONT # Johnathan Smith b 30 APR 1711 Hopewell, Hunterdon, NJ m ABT 1738 Hixon d 20 AUG 1791 
2 CONT # George Smith b 20 FEB 1712/13 Hopewell, Hunterdon, NJ ABT 1738  m:  Mershon   
2 CONT # Charles Smith b 30 NOV 1714 Hopewell, Hunterdon, NJ  d 12 AUG 1718 
2 CONT # Anna Smith b 28 JAN 1715/16 Hopewell, Hunterdon, NJ m ABT 1736 John Titus Hopewell, Hunterdon, NJ  d 1 AUG 1777          
2 CONT # Charles Smith b 30 DEC 1718 Hopewell, Hunterdon, NJ  d 8 AUG 1799   
2 CONT # Mary Smith b 19 SEP 1720 Hopewell, Hunterdon, NJ d 23 MAR 1757 
2 CONT # Joseph Smith b 24 JUL 1722 Hopewell, Hunterdon, NJ d 19 AUG 1799         
2 CONT # John Smith b 19 JUL 1724 Hopewell, Hunterdon, NJ d 7 SEP 1799          
2 CONT # Thomas Smith b 7 NOV 1727 Hopewell, Hunterdon, NJ d  3 SEP 1799          
2 CONT # Timothy Smith b 20 NOV 1730 Hopewell, Hunterdon, NJ d 19 FEB 1796   
2 CONT
2 CONT At least one ambitious person traces Sarah quite a ways back:
2 CONT
2 CONT (MARY22 SMITH, SARAH21 STOUT, REBECCA20 ASHTON (this appears to be an error - Sarah was the daughter of a different wife, not Rebecca), DELIVERANCE19 THROCKMORTON, JOHN18, BASSINGBORNE17, ELIZABETH16 BLENNERHASSET, ELIZABETH15 COR
2 CONC NWALLIS, JOHN14, WILLIAM13, PHILIPPA12 TYRREL, ANNE11 PASHLEY, PHILIPPA10 SERGEAUX, PHILIPPA FITZ9 ALAN, SIBYL DE8 MONTAGU, WILLIAM DE7, WILLIAM DE6, SIMON DE5, WILLIAM DE4, DREW DE3, WILLIAM DE2, RICHARD DE1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT One site has Sarah's death date as 24 Apr 1767.
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah was the daughter of Jonathan and Anna (Bollen) Stout, and the wife of Andrew Smith, 1689-1767. Sarah and Andrew were the parents of eleven children: Andrew, 1709-1794; Jonathan, 1711-1791; George W., 1713-1799; Charles, 1714
2 CONC -1718; Anna, 1716-1787; Charles, 1718-1744; Mary, 1720-1757; Joseph, 1722-1744; John, 1724-1744; Thomas, 1727-1744; and Timothy, 1730-1796. 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=16879306
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
