2 CONT == Biography ==
2 CONT Sarah Stout, daughter of Jonathan and Anne Bollen Stout, born September 10 1689 and died April 25 1761. She married Andrew Smith Jr  <ref>''Pioneers of Old Hopewell", Ralph Ege, 1908, page 67 https://play.google.com/books/reader?i
2 CONC d=uQR_vjf2_EEC&printsec=frontcover&output=reader&hl=en&pg=GBS.PA72.w.1.4.0</ref>, <ref>''Historical and genealogical miscellany'', John Stilwell, 1916, page 333 http://archive.org/stream/historicalgeneal04stil#page/333/mode/1up</r
