2 CONC s of Andrew Smith", Charlotte Williams, http://www.genealogy.com/ftm/j/e/f/Charlotte-Williams-Jeffers-AR/GENE18-0002.html</ref>  They were the parents of Andrew III, Jonathan, George, Charles b. 1714d 1718,  Anne, Charles, Mary, J
