2 CONT
2 CONT ==Sources==*[https://books.google.com/books?id=GXYRAAAAIAAJ&printsec=frontcover#v=onepage&q&f=false ''A General History of he Baptist Denomination in America, and other parts of the World Vol. 1'']; Benedict, David; 1813,page 571
2 CONT <references/>
