2 CONT * Reference: [http://wc.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=ronaldwebb&id=I05371 RootsWeb's WorldConnect] - [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Dec 10 2016, 0:13:22 UTC''
