2 CONT == Biography ==
2 CONT Hannah Stout, daughter of Jonathan and Anne Bollen Stout, was born March 29 1694 and died July 14 1779.  She married Jediah H Higgins Jr, son of Jediah Sr and Mary Newbold Higgins about 1715. They were the parents of Joseph m. (1)
2 CONC  Mary Phillips, (2) Elizabeth Unknown,  Jonathan mAnn Britton, Joshua m Mary Quick, James m Sarah Stout, Mary m. Benjamin Stout, Rachel m James Stout as his second wife, Hannah m Henry Gulick and Ann m Robert Davisson. <ref>''Rich
2 CONC ard Higgins'', Mrs. KatherineElizabeth Chapin Higgins, 1918, pages 90-91https://books.google.com/books?id=jONUAAAAMAAJ&pg=PA59</ref> <ref>''Calendar of New Jersey wills, administrations, etc'', William Nelson, etal, Vol 5 page 243
