2 CONT “The History of the Stout Family, First Settling in Middletown, Monmouth County, New Jersey.” By Nathan Stout, 1823 . Second printing by H.G. McCarter, "Herald" Office, Hopewell, N.J., 1878 with additions by Mrs. Sarah Weart, Thir
