1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Anne Stout''' was born in 1734 in Hopewell Township, Hunterdon County, New Jersey, United States. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34850365849 Dr. Jonathan Stout, MD] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34789327969 
2 CONC Mary Stout (Leigh)]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Anne married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34850378383 Andrew Stout, I] on January 24, 1753 in Hopewell Township, Hunterdon County, New Jersey, United States. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34850378385 Elizabeth Stout];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34850378386 Mary Stout];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34850378387 {Infant} Stout];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34850378388 Anna Stout];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34850378390 Andrew Stout, IIa];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34850378389 Anna Stout];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34850378391 Sarah Bryant (Stout)];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34850378392 Andrew Stout, II];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34850378393 Susannah Stout];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34850378394 Joab Stout];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34850378395 Urie Stout]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on March 31, 1777 in Hopewell Township, Hunterdon County, New Jersey, United States. 
