2 CONT ===Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Stout-740
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Anna Stout, daughter of Jonathan and Mary Leigh (Lee) Stout, born about 1734 and died March 31 1777. She married Andrew Stout, son of Capt David and Elizabeth Larrison Stout, January 2 1753 in Hopewell, NJ. They were the parents o
2 CONC f fifteen of whom only four reached the age of maturity. [1] [2] [3]. She died March 31 1777 and Andrew married (2) Sarah Stout Morgan, widow of Moses Morgan and his first wife's sister, June 22 1777. [1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Three children survived and are named in his will.
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1. Elizabeth "Betsy" b Jan 11 1754 m Ichabod Leigh (Lee)
2 CONT * 2. Mary b Jun 121 1755 d Sep 13 1773
2 CONT * 3. Unnamed b 1758 d 1758
2 CONT * 4. Anna (twin) b Feb 23 1759 d July 1759
2 CONT * 5. Sarah (twin) b Feb 23 1759 d 1783
2 CONT * 6. Unnamed b Jul 9 1761 d 1761
2 CONT * 7. Anna b Mar 6 1763 m Johnson Titus
2 CONT * 8. Andrew (twin) b Dec 6 1766 d Feb 1767
2 CONT * 9. Ruth (twin) b Dec 6 1766 d 1778
2 CONT * 10. Andrew b Sep 19 1768 m Deborah Golden
2 CONT * 11. Joab b Aug 24 1771 d. Nov 1772
2 CONT * 12. Ure b Mar 6 1775 d Dec 1775
2 CONT * 13. Unnamed b Jan 2 1777 d Apr 1777
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT In Andrew Stout's will date June 10 1806 he names two Annas. One of them married a Hunt and the other a Titus and Susannah Hart is not in the children named by any of the three sources used. See the disclaimer given by the author 
2 CONC regarding two daughters named Anna and one named Susannah following the will. [4]
