2 CONC le/Jesse-Stout/6000000041128303505 Jesse], [https://www.geni.com/people/Amos-Stout/6000000208421107824 Amos], Charles, Rachel, Elizabeth, [https://www.geni.com/people/Catharine-Bryant/6000000061319585877 Catherine] and [https://ww
