1 NOTE {geni:about_me} "The issue of Jesse Stout and his wife, Abigail Lott (mentioned in foregoing history), five sons and seven daughters, were as follows, viz: Spencer, Jonathan, Peter L., Charles G., Abraham L., Susan, Charity, Naomi
2 CONC , Betsy, Theodocia, Kitty and Abigail. -- The History of the Stout Family First Settling in Middletown, Monmouth County, New Jersey, page 35, by Nathan Stout, 1823
2 CONT
2 CONT Copied from [https://www.ancestry.com/mediaui-viewer/collection/1030/tree/28774504/person/26895515446/media/94fcf9ee-ff78-45c3-950c-aa11cd7495fb?galleryindex=4&sort=-created Ancestry]:
2 CONT Children of Jesse Stout and Abigail Lott
2 CONT Posted Dec 8, 2018 by marthaschuyler
2 CONT +1. Spencer married Mary Weart born 1787; died 3 Mar 1846. Mary is buried in McLean Cemetery Groton Twp Tompkins Co. NY.
2 CONT
2 CONT +2. Johnathan born 1792; married 27 Oct 1811 Jane Blue born 1792; died 1822.
2 CONT
2 CONT +3. Peter Lott born about 23 Mar 1788; died 23 Apr 1860; married Wealthy Luther born 20 Sep 1793; died 12 Sep 1885; daughter of Ezra Luther and Rebecca Sheldon Hart Luther.
2 CONT
2 CONT +4. Charles born 3 June 1797; died 27 Oct 1859; married Ure Hart born 4 Aug 1799; died 23 Aug 1892; daughter of Amos Hart and Ruth Stout.
2 CONT
2 CONT +5. Abraham L. married Sarah Crittenden. This is probably Sally Stout born about 1810; died 22 Feb 1846; buried McLean Cemetery Groton Twp. Tompkins Co. NY.
2 CONT
2 CONT 6. Susan born 19 Oct 1780; died 23 Nov 1845 Hopewell NJ; married John Weart Jr. born 17 Apr 1777.
2 CONT
2 CONT 7. Charity married Michael Blue.
2 CONT
2 CONT 8. Naomi married Amos Gibbins.
2 CONT
2 CONT 9. Betsy married Daniel Luther born 24 Aug 1789; son of Ezra Luther and Rebecca Sheldon Hart Luther.
2 CONT
2 CONT 10. Theodosia born Mar 1795; died 19 July 1869; married Joseph Snowden Hart born Sep 1796; died 20 Feb 1858; son of Timothy Hart and Sarah Hart.
2 CONT
2 CONT 11. Kitty married Jacob Weart.
2 CONT
2 CONT 12. Abigail married 24 Nov 1832 Zephaniah Stout; son of William Stout and Ann Sexton.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source:  http://www.angelfire.com/ny/chickened/stoutfamily.html
2 CONT
