2 CONC pkins Cemetery, Davis County, Iowa. He married in 1826 in Rutherford County, North Carolina Dotia McCormick, born in 1804 in Rutherfordton, Rutherford County, North Carolina; died in 1874 in Fabius Township, Davis County, Iowa; bu
2 CONC ried in Hopkins Cemetery, Davis County, Iowa. To this union were born:
