1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/24817757/william-burch Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Aug 18 2019, 23:37:58 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT William was the oldest son of Joel BURCH and Matilda BURCH. His parents were 1st cousins once removed. William had a brother Hiram born in 1843 and a sister Mary Ann born in 1850. 
2 CONT
2 CONT William's father, Joel BURCH, was a farmer and William became a farmer as well. To my knowledge William lived his entire life in Indian Creek Township in Monroe County. 
2 CONT
2 CONT William married his second cousin, Susannah L. STORM, on Feb 11, 1863 in Monroe County. William was twenty years old at the time of his marriage. His new wife, Susan, was eighteen. Susan STORM was the daughter of Peter and Jane [B
2 CONC URCH] STORM. 
2 CONT
2 CONT William and Susan had a large family. Susan had 10 or 11 births and seven children who lived to adulthood. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Hiram Asbury BURCH          1865 – 1924 Infant daughter             1866 – 1866 Mary "Jennie" NEAL          1868 – 1914 Sarah Elizabeth CARTER MAY  1869 – 1940 Infant twin daughter        1869 – 1870 Joel Preston BURCH          18
2 CONC 71 – 1930 Martha Matilda "Mat" BURCH  1873 –  Margaret Olive MITCHELL     1875 – 1929 Infant daughter             1877 – 1877 Isaac Peter BURCH           1878 – 1945 Jemima C. BURCH             1880 – 1880
2 CONT
2 CONT The Burch home must have been very full. In addition to their many children, William and Susan took in boarders. At various times they housed William's orphaned nephews (Edward and William Wampler) and an orphan girl named Mamie L
2 CONC ake. Likewise three of the Burch children did not marry or move away during their parents' lifetimes (oldest son Hiram never married, youngest son Pete married Mamie Lake but did not move out, and daughter Matilda did not marry un
2 CONC til late in life).
2 CONT
2 CONT William died in 1901 at the age of 58.* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/24817757/william-burch Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Feb 20 2021, 21:49:36 UTC''
