1 NOTE {geni:about_me} John Southern Burch was married first to Sarah Stewart, 1821-1870;  then to Sarah Edwards, 1830-1916, whom he married in 1873.  I believe Mary's mother was Sarah Stewart. John being married to two wives named Sarah
2 CONC , and both of then being buried in the Burch Cemetery, makes for a confusing situation.  There are also marriage records for a John Burch to a Sarah Jane Matthews, but I don't think it is the same John Burch.   Provided by KMJ-41 
2 CONC #48855685
