1 NAME Susannah "Susan" Lunsford /Storm/
2 GIVN Susannah "Susan" Lunsford
2 SURN Storm
2 _MARNM Burch
2 NICK Drugan
2 NICK Susan Burch
2 NICK Susan Storm
1 SEX F
1 BURI
2 PLAC Burch Cemetery, Kirksville, Monroe County, Indiana, USA
