2 CONT Locky Burch formerly Collins
2 CONT * Born 21 Aug 1815 in Virginia, United States
2 CONT * Daughter of Micajah Collins and Martha Patsey Beasley
2 CONT * Sister of Floyd Collins	
2 CONT * Wife of Davis Burch — married 1 Nov 1831 in ,Greene, Indiana, United States
2 CONT * Mother of Levisa Burch, William Floyd Burch, Jonathan Jones Burch, David Lee Burch, George Micajah Burch, Infant Burch, Martha Ann Burch, Elizabeth Jane Burch, James Thomas Burch and Mary Leta Burch
2 CONT * Died 25 Dec 1860 at age 45 in Greene, Indiana
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT mother of:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.  [http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=5137090 Levisa Burch] - b. 12/10/1835, d. 09/12/1837 2.  William Floyd Burch - b. 05/29/1837 m. Nancy Crane 3.  Jonathan Jones Burch - b. 10/29/1839  m. [http://www.findag
2 CONC rave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=45840122 Martha Ann (Wolf) Karns], d. May 27 1894 in Mo. They were the parents of: •  [http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid= 45576180 Charles D. Burch] who died as an infant.  
2 CONC •  [http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid= 72558495 William Harlow Burch]  b 11-12-1883  m [http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid= 45839187 Anna Mae Stockton], d 1-1-1919.(*) •  [http://www.findagra
2 CONC ve.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid= 70555630 Grover Cleveland Burch] b 3-9-1885, d 8-30-1926 •  [http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid= 70601621 Pansy Mae B. Owens] b-10-5-1887, d 3-27-1981 •  Jonathon Claude  Burc
2 CONC h b-5-5-1890, d 6-04-1974 •  Frank Lee Burch b-6-14-1891, d-9-05-1935                       
2 CONT
2 CONT 4.  [http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=5137034 Davis Lee Burch] - b. 02/10/1842, d. 03/26/1842 5.  [http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=5137048 George Micajah Burch] - b. 09/26/1844, m. Martha
2 CONC  Stone, d. 05/19/1916 6.  Martha Ann Burch - b. 01/10/1849, d. 03/04/1930 7.  Elizabeth Jane B. Crane - b. 08/26/1851, d. 10/05/1933 8.  [http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=5137075 James Thomas Burch] - b. 08/26
2 CONC /1854, m. Sarah Pickard, d. 03/12/1881
2 CONT
2 CONT *  William Harlow Burch is said, by oral family history, to be "buried in Hailey, MO, by the schoolhouse."
2 CONT
2 CONT [I welcome any documentation as to changes needed regarding the above information.  Jason O] Inscription: In memory of LOCKY wife of ELDER DAVIS BURCH a member of the Regular Pri. Baptist Church DIED Dec. 25, 1860 in the triumphs 
2 CONC of faith AGED 45Yrs. 3M. 28D. Her last words were, So Blessed be my God I was told in his word That an end to my Troubles I'll find.
