1 NOTE {geni:about_me} William COLLINS (COLLINGS) was the s/o Micajah COLLINGS and Martha BEASLEY, who moved to Greene County c1832.
2 CONT
2 CONT  William was b. c1810 in VA; d. c1858 in Randolph Co., AR. He md/1 Martha BURCH, d/o Charles BURCH and Elizabeth SUTHERLAND, Dec 1832 probably in IN. They were divorced c1845 in Greene County. 
2 CONT
2 CONT William md/2 Purlina BURCH, 27 Dec 1847 in Gibson Co., IN. She was b. 1824 in NC; d. 1893 (Greene Co?).
2 CONT
2 CONT The children of William and Martha:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Fuel COLLINS; md. Eliza J. DANIEL, 24 Sep 1850 in Greene Co., IN.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Locky COLLINS, b. c1836 in Greene Co., IN; md. George W. DANIEL, 30 Mar 1852 in Greene Co., IN.
2 CONT
2 CONT The children of William and Purlina:
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. William Thomas (Tom) COLLINS, b. 15 Apr 1848 in Gibson Co., IN; d. 08 Mar 1933 in Tolar, Hood Co., TX; bur. Strouds Creek Cemetery, Hood Co., TX; md/1 Delitha [WORKMAN] MARTINDALE BARTLEY, 01 Sep 1868 in Greene Co., IN; md/2 Sa
2 CONC rah Jane [CUNNINGHAM] BRAZELL, 01 Jun 1896 in Hood Co., TX.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. John COLLINS, b. 27 Nov 1855 in Randolph Co., AR; d. 08 Feb 1934 in Pampa, Gray Co., TX; bur. Graceland Cemetery, Meade Co., KS; md. Julia Ann CLAY, 02 Jun 1878 in Mountain Grove, Wright Co., MO.
2 CONT
2 CONT 5. Eunice Malissa COLLINS, b. 27 Nov 1855 in Randolph Co., AR; md/1 W.J. ABRAMS; md/2 --- SHIELDS.
2 CONT
2 CONT ========================================
2 CONT
