1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Fuel & Eliza Jane (Daniel) Collins were married September 24, 1850 in Greene Co., IN. Children of this union: George Washington, William Pierce, Mary Jane, Martha, and William Pierce (1853-1943).
2 CONT
2 CONT After Eliza died in 1864, Fuel then married Sarah Jane Anderson, daughter of Zeka and Hettie Anderson, 08/22/1865. Sarah Jane was born 03/1849 in Kentucky, and died in 1931.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1860 Grand River, Wayne Co. IA census: Fuel Collins, 25, IN (listed as Fred on Ancestry); E. J. 29  b. IN.; G. W. 8 b. IN; William J. 6 b. IN; and M. J. 2 b. IA.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1870 Richland Twp., Decatur Co. IA census: Fuel Collins, 36, IN;  Sarah J., 22, KY; Mary J., 11, IA; William, 16, IN; Martha A., 9, IA; and Rufus, 8 mo., IA.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1880 Richland Twp., Decatur Co. IA census: F. Collins, 47, IN, father VA, mother NC; Sarah J., 31, KY/TN/TN;  Rufus, 11, IA; Eliza E., 8, IA; Emily, 6, IA; Maria E., 4, IA; and Minnie B., 2, IA.
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of: 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. George Washington Collins 2. Mary Jane C. Kirkpatrick 3. Martha A. C. Blunt 4. Eliza Ellen C. Kirkpatrick 5. Emma "Emily" C. Denton 6. James Richard Collins 7. Benjamin Franklin Collins 8. Wesley Collins William Pierce Collins 
2 CONC (1853 - 1943)* Luke Rufus Collins (1869 - 1943)* Elizabeth Collins Hatfield (1876 - 1958)* Minna Bell Collins (1878 - 1880)* Margaret Lena Collins Palmer (1880 - 1935)*
2 CONT
