2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.myheritage.com/research/record-40001-149309989/thomas-jefferson-burch-in-familysearch-family-tree FamilySearch Family Tree] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Dec 31 2017, 22:1
2 CONC 5:22 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Thomas Jefferson BURCH, the seventh child of Benjamin and Marian BURCH, was born February 28, 1859. He departed this life March 13, 1924, at the age of sixty-five years and fourteen days.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was born in Center Township, and spent his entire life there with the exception of two years, which he spent near WELCH Station in Fairplay Township.
2 CONT
2 CONT He lived with his mother until she died on August 20, 1912, and stayed at the old home the remainder of his life.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was a respected citizen and attended strictly to his own business. He was honest in his dealing with his fellow man, and although he never affiliated with any church he believed in a Supreme Being and departed this life content
2 CONC ed.
2 CONT
2 CONT He leaves to mourn his death, two sisters, Mrs. Polly DAY, Of Worthington, and Mrs. Margaret CHRISTENBERRY, of Center Township, and one brother, Daniel BURCH, of Hobbieville, besides a host of relatives and friends.
