1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===William Harris
2 CONT *Gender:	Male Birth:	Circa 1707   Albemarle, Virginia, USA
2 CONT *Death:	Hanover, Virginia, USA
2 CONT *Father:	William Harris
2 CONT *Mother:	Temperance Overton
2 CONT *Wife:	Elizabeth Burnett<br/>
2 CONT <br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT
2 CONT # Benjamin Harris
2 CONT # Fredrick Harris
2 CONT # Robert Harris
2 CONT # William Overton Harris, b: 1730 Hanover Co, VA
2 CONT # Jemima Harris
2 CONT # Keziah Harris
2 CONT # Temperance Harris
2 CONT # Mary Harris
2 CONT # Ann Harris
2 CONT # John Harris.
2 CONT # 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT > Granville Militia 1754 under Col William Eaton while living amidst the Saponi and Cheraw of Tabb's Creek of Granville/Gates Co, NC.  (Must be a different William Harris)
2 CONT
2 CONT ----  This doesn’t seem right if https://www.geni.com/people/William-Harris-II/6000000008630339810 died 1749.  It’s his William.
2 CONT
2 CONT From http://nelson-dna-project.tripod.com/docs2/Nelson_Of_Hanover.pdf Page 9
2 CONT
2 CONT DISCUSSION:
2 CONT
2 CONT A letter to Mrs. Charles E. Dille, 2601 Park Avenue, Cairo, Illinois, dated 1 August 1929 from Professor W. E. Dickinson, University of West Virginia, Morgantown, West VA, charts the HARRIS PEDIGREE as follows: I
2 CONT
2 CONT CAPTAIN WILLIAM HARRIS married ca 1695 TEMPERANCE OVERTON, born 2 March 1679; died 9 Feb 1710 - ISSUE: -
2 CONT
2 CONT vii.. WILLIAM HARRIS JUNIOR, born 1707 - married Henrietta and had issue 
2 CONT
2 CONT *a. JOHN HARRIS
2 CONT *b. WILLIAM OVERTON HARRIS, b 1730, d 1789; married 1752 ANN (NANCY) NELSON, b 1731; dau of EDWARD NELSON, immigrant
2 CONT *c. FREDERICK HARRIS, m a cousin, ELIZA TERRELL -9 and had issue:
2 CONT *d. KEZIAH HARRIS, m 1750 JAMES NELSON (1723-1803) son of EDWARD NELSON, an immigrant
2 CONT *e. ANN HARRIS m WILLIAM DAY
2 CONT *f. TEMPERANCE HARRIS - m SAMUEL BAKER
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT WILLIAM HARRIS JUNIOR, son of WILLIAM AND TEMPERANCE (OVERTON) HARRIS, born before 1710; married (probably ______ BURNETT?) (Ref: History of Louisa Co by Malcolm H. Harris, p 349)
2 CONT
2 CONT Ibid, page 224 -
2 CONT
2 CONT WILLIAM OVERTON HARRIS (born 1730) married ANN (NANCY) NELSON, born 1731, daughter of EDWARD and MARY (GARLAND) NELSON; (Ref; 26 T p 272; 27 T p 37) - Vestry Book of St Peter's Parish, New Kent Co, VA (1684-1786) by VA State Libra
2 CONC ry, page 360
2 CONT
