1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT From https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Harris-1874
2 CONT
2 CONT James was born in 1694 or 1704 in Pamunkey River, St Peter Parish, New Kent, Virginia. He is  a  son of William Harris (born 1652 in Virginia) and Temperance Overton (born 2 March 1678/1679 in Hanover County, Virginia). [1] He mar
2 CONC ried Sarah Crawford. Notes also indicate he married Ann Nelson and had a child named Nelson Harris.[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Sources 
2 CONT * https://archive.org/stream/harrisgenealogy00harr#page/48/mode/1up/search/James+harris --------------------
