1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Capt. Robert Harris''' was born on March 8, 1741, in St Martin Parish, Louisa, Virginia, United States. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-18139023 Christopher Harris] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34768194625 M
2 CONC ary Elizabeth Harris]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34723479222 Ann Woodson Harris] on December 7, 1789, in Greenville, Augusta, Virginia, United States. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-34768194113
2 CONC  John Proctor Harris, Sr]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in November 1809 in Surry, North Carolina, United States. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Origins 
2 CONT
2 CONT Christopher Harris and Mary (Dabney) Harris had seven children: Dabney, Sarah, Robert, Mourning, Christopher, Mary, and Tyre.  
