2 CONT ** Reference: [https://familysearch.org/tree/person/details/L6RY-B6B FamilySearch Genealogy] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Jun 7 2024, 14:40:16 UTC''
