2 CONT
2 CONT No stone. Burial plot is unknown.
2 CONT Samuel Harris is the son of "Old Kentucky Pioneer" Christopher Harris and Agnes McCord his second wife. Christopher and Agnes are buried in Madison County Kentucky.
2 CONT
2 CONT His son Overton Gentry Harris and family are buried here.
2 CONT His daughter Mary Ann Harris married George Smith and they are buried here.
2 CONT His great grandson Wood Harris son of Overton Smith Harris and Susan Frances Griffith is  buried here. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Samuel appears on the 1840 census in Clay County widowed with sons Overton Gentry Harris 17, Napoleon Tevis Harris 10, Thomas Richardson Harris 6 and daughter Mary Ann Harris 13.* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/19
