1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Elizabeth Dickerson''' was born on August 26, 1768 in Albemarle County, Virginia, United States. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-28883273 William Dalton] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-28883346 Rachel Dalton].
2 CONC  She was a Housewife. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34736514240 John Cosby Dickerson, Sr.] on December 19, 1790 in Albemarle, Virginia, United States, Albemarle County, Virginia, United States. Together they had the following children
2 CONC : [https://www.geni.com/profile-34753892098 George Washington Dickerson]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34736932026 Robert Nathaniel Dickerson]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34627956920 Rachel Turner]; [https://www.geni.com/profi
2 CONC le-34753892103 Mildred &quot;Millie&quot; Hubert]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34673438669 Charlotte Stovall]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34685356959 John Cosby Dickerson, Jr]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-123032445 Eleanor 
2 CONC Wright]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34736932021 Kinchen Dickerson]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34753892104 Walter Waller Dickerson]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34753892100 David Martin Dickerson]; [https://www.geni.com/pr
2 CONC ofile-24643767293 James Dansan Dickerson]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34765799711 William Leroy Dickerson]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34753892105 Wilson Dickerson]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34753892106 Richardson Mario
2 CONC n Dickerson]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in 1835 in Sumner, Tennessee, United States, Albemarle, Virginia, United States. 
2 CONT ----
