1 NAME Nathan /Crawford/
2 GIVN Nathan
2 SURN Crawford
2 _MARNM Crawford
1 SEX M
1 BURI
2 PLAC Crawford Family Cemetery, Appling, Columbia County, Georgia, USA
2 ADDR
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1768
2 PLAC South Carolina, USA
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1789
2 PLAC Richmond County, Georgia, USA
2 ADDR
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Georgia Wills and Probate Records, 1742-1992, Richmond County,  Vol. 1, 1777-1798
2 CONT
2 CONT In the name of God, amen, I Nathan Crawford being of sound mind and memory though in a low state of health do recommend my Soul to God who gave it and my body to the dust from whence it came. I do constitute this my l, ast Will an
2 CONC d Testament and dispose of all my worldly goods which it hath pleased God to bestow on me in the following manner.
2 CONT
2 CONT Firstly I will and bequeath unto my Brother Joel Crawford, one pair of Black Breeches, one pair of Stakins (?) & one shirt.
2 CONT
2 CONT Secondly I give unto my Brother David one Coat & waiscot & shirt.
2 CONT
2 CONT Thirdly I give unto Brother Wm. Crawford my Trunk Razor & strap, a shag wascoat & shirt.
2 CONT
2 CONT Fourthly I give unto Brother Charles my Saddle & Bridle & all my other wearing apparrel.
2 CONT
2 CONT Fifthly I will that my land in South Carolina be equally divided amongst my four sisters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sixthly I will and bequeath unto my mother, Frances Crawford my horse and all my debts due & demands after my  Lawful debts are paid.
2 CONT
2 CONT Seventhly I will & bequeath my gun to my Brother Robert Crawford.
2 CONT
2 CONT Lastly I do appoint & Constitute my Brother Joel Crawford my executor to this my last Will and Testament. In witness whereof I have unto set my hand & Seal this 11th Day of November 1789.
2 CONT
2 CONT                                Nathan Crawford
2 CONT
2 CONT Signed, Sealed & Delivered in presence of Nathaniel Barnett and Wm. Barnett.* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/166038362/nathan-crawford Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartC
