1 NAME Sen. William H. Crawford (DemRep-GA), U.S. Sec. of War and Treasury
1 SEX M
1 BURI
2 PLAC Crawford Cemetery
2 ADDR
3 CITY Crawford
3 STAE Georgia
3 CTRY United States
1 BIRT
2 DATE 24 FEB 1772
2 ADDR
3 STAE Province of Virginia
