1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Harris-1940
2 CONT
2 CONT (1) This version is considered "the most probable": A William Harris is said to have married Ann Mitchell in 1772 in Albemarle County, Virginia. Later Ann Harris signed a petition setting forth that her husband, "William Harris, d
2 CONC eparted this life Feb, 1792 on his way to Kentucky, having made his last will and testament in writing, and since his death she hath removed herself and her family to Mercer County (from Madison County) KY, and will is recorded th
2 CONC ere, Sat., Nov. 17, 1792. Married 1772, Ann Mitchell [Harris].[1] No children were reported from this marriage in the petition cited.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References
2 CONT # [https://books.google.com/books?id=SKRRAAAAMAAJ&pg=PA51#v=onepage&q&f=false Page 51 - 52] of Harris Genealogy. Keith printing Company, 1914 - 107 pages.  Bible record.  William Harris, born March 15, 1752.  Miss Michie, Miss Tho
2 CONC mpson. Hannah Jameson.
