1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://freepages.genealogy.rootsweb.com/~lopezislandhistory/thompson.txt
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert THOMPSON, son of Robert THOMPSON, was born about 1713 in New Kent County, Virginia, died about  Mar 1788 in Amherst County, Virginia.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert married (1) about 1732 in Cumberland(?) County, Virginia to Patience _____ born about 1715 in Virginia(?), died about 1745/1755 in Cumberland County, Virginia.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert married (2) about 1760 in Amherst(?) County, Virginia to Catherine _____ born about 1740 in Amherst(?) County, Virginia, died 1820 in Amherst County, Virginia.
2 CONT
2 CONT === NOTES FOR Robert THOMPSON ===
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''LAND:''' Robert THOMPSON sold 150 acres on Buckingham Road, Cumberland County, to son Bartlett on Jan 22, 1759 (Deed Book 2, page 442). This is about the time he married Catherine and moved to Amherst County.
2 CONT * '''PROBATE:''' Will of Robert THOMPSON dated 26 Sep 1787 and probated 7 Apr 1788 in Amherst County, Virginia (Book _, page 71-73). 
2 CONT ** Mentions first children: Mary MARSHALL, Josiah, Robert, Patience SMITH, Bartlett, Rhoda WATKINS, Benajah, and Anna MORRIS. 
2 CONT ** Mentions last six children by wife Catherine: Jenny SIMMONS, Mitchel, Margret, David, John, and Nelson. 
2 CONT ** The last six children were given land in Kentucky containing 1,451 acres!
2 CONT * '''QUESTION-LAND:''' Daughter? (was married to Mr. SMITH at the time), Patience THOMPSON received 50 acres in Southern Parish, Cumberland County, from Henry MACON on Aug 26, 1765 (Deed book 4, page 42).
2 CONT * '''QUESTION:''' A Patience THOMPSON married about 1735 in Cumberland County, Virginia to Daniel COLEMAN, born about 1710/1713 in Virginia to Daniel and Patience (ELLIOTT) COLEMAN.
2 CONT
2 CONT === CHILDREN of Robert THOMPSON and Patience _____ ===
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''16 Mary THOMPSON''' b abt 1733 Cumberland County, Virginia. M _____ MARSHALL.
2 CONT * '''17 Josiah THOMPSON''' b abt 1734 Cumberland County, Virginia. M Mary SWANN.
2 CONT * '''18 Robert THOMPSON''' b abt 1735 Cumberland County, Virginia. M Catherine LESEUER.
2 CONT * '''19 Patience or Martha THOMPSON''' b abt 1737 Cumberland County, Virginia. M Lawrence SMITH.
2 CONT * '''20 Bartlett THOMPSON''' b abt 1739 Cumberland County, Virginia. M Susannah HATCHER.
2 CONT * '''21 Rhoda THOMPSON''' b abt 1740 Cumberland County, Virginia. M Edward WATKINS.
2 CONT * '''22 Rebecca THOMPSON''' b abt 1741 Cumberland County, Virginia. M George E. WATKINS.
2 CONT * '''23 Benajah or Benager THOMPSON''' b abt 1742 Cumberland County, Virginia. M Drucilla HOBSON.
2 CONT * '''24 Anna THOMPSON''' b abt 1744 Cumberland County, Virginia. M _____ MORRIS.
2 CONT
2 CONT === CHILDREN of Robert THOMPSON and Catherine _____ ===
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''25 Jane Jenny THOMPSON''' b 4 Apr 1762 Amherst County, Virginia. M _____ SIMMONS.
2 CONT * '''26 Mitchell THOMPSON''' b 30 Aug 1766 Amherst County, Virginia, d Mar 1854 Carroll County, Virginia.
2 CONT * '''27 Archibald THOMPSON''' b 29 Nov 1768/1769 Amherst(?) County, Virginia, d 1787.
2 CONT * '''28 Margaret THOMPSON''' b 16 Oct 1771 Amherst(?) County, Virginia.
2 CONT * '''29 David THOMPSON''' b 12 Sep 1775 Amherst(?) County, Virginia.
2 CONT * '''30 John THOMPSON''' b 12 May 1777 Amherst(?) County, Virginia.
2 CONT * '''31 Nelson THOMPSON''' b 5 Aug 1781 Amherst(?) County, Virginia.
