2 CONT Elizabeth Brown (c. 1740); identified by nephew Reuben Dabney Brown as a child of the first marriage. She was a daughter of Benjamin Brown and Miss Wilson.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==== Early Life and Identity ====
2 CONT Elizabeth is identified in the Brown family records—most notably those maintained by her nephew Reuben Dabney Brown—as one of the six children belonging to Benjamin Brown's first marriage. Because of the repetitive naming conventi
2 CONC ons of the "B" Browns, her identity is frequently conflated in digital trees with her half-sisters or nieces who shared the same name.
