1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Mary Candler married Captain Zachariah Moorman (also a soldier in Crowell's Army). Zack and Mary joined the newly blossoming Quaker movement. Presently, the Moormans (or at least some of their children) moved to Am
2 CONC erica. Their Moorman/Clark/Johnson descendants may be found
2 CONT
2 CONT in early Virginia Quaker records in Henrico and New Kent Counties.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT owned a "wayside" at Sandy Bottom along the French Broad River. This is a stagecoach Inn.
