2 CONT
2 CONT This Margaret Elizabeth Blackwell (Abercrombie) is the daughter of James Abercrombie 1740-1819 Laurens Co.,SC. & his 2nd wife, Elizabeth Sherrill (1758-1819).  Married 1783.
2 CONT
2 CONT She is named in her father's will, which is reported on her father's FAG page.
2 CONT
2 CONT The biggest problem is that There are at least 2 men named James Abercrombie who lived in & around Laurens Co., SC at similar time in early S.C. history.
