2 CONT Thomas2 Delahay (William1) was born in N. Sheilds, England, or Charles co., Maryland about 1661. Thomas died February 10, 1699 in island creek, Talbot Co., Maryland, at 37 years of age. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Eve Rich in old Whitemarsh, Talbot Co., Maryland, July 9, 1681. Eve was born in Talbot, Maryland about 1660. Eve was the daughter of William Riche Planter and Alice Paddison MRS. Eve died 1724 in Talbot Co., MD, at 64 y
2 CONC ears of age. Eve and Richard Holmes were sealed January 25, 1979. Temple Code: SLAKE. Eve and Thomas Delahay were sealed May 24, 1991. Temple Code: PROVO. Eve was baptized a member of The Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saint
2 CONC s February 8, 1994. Temple Code: SLAKE. She was endowed June 23, 1994. Temple Code: SLAKE. She was sealed to her parents July 19, 1994. Temple Code: SLAKE. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas was baptized a member of The Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints May 5, 1934. Temple Code: SLAKE. Thomas and Eve Rich were sealed May 24, 1991. Temple Code: PROVO. He was sealed to his parents July 18, 1995. Temple 
2 CONC Code: BOUNT. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas Delahay and Eve Rich had the following children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT  3 i. Sarah3 Delahay was born in st peters, Talbot Co., Maryland April 21, 1682. She married John Hopkins in of, Talbot Co., MD, about 1702. John was born in st peters, Talbot Co., Maryland about 1682. 
