2 CONT
2 CONT Returning now to what is known as the early history of old White Marsh Church, we glean some information from the official record of "Births, Marriages and Deaths, St. Peter's Parish." For instance, there is the record of the birt
2 CONC h of William Riche of this parish on the 9th of July 1681, but the name of the minister officiating at the baptism is not given. The following is another record: "Thomas Delahay, son of Thomas Delahay and Eve his wife, was borne y
2 CONC e 23rd of October Ano Domi 1689 and christened, pr. Rev. Joseph Leech."
