2 CONC lable online at https://www.google.com/books/edition/The_Brewster_Genealogy_1566_1907/bjU2AAAAMAAJ?hl=en&gbpv=1&dq=John+William+Augustus+Brewster&pg=PA409&printsec=frontcover
