1 NOTE {geni:about_me} This is Abner Ford Lindsay, (b. Nov. 29, 1822 Henry Co., KY -d. Sept. 19, 1893, Bond Twp., Lawrence Co., IL. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the oldest son of Hazael Lindsay,(1801-1874), and Sarah (Ford) Lindsay, (1805-1869), both buried in the Ford Cemetery, Crawford Co., IL. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Abner's 1st wife, (md. Apr. 18, 1844 Crawford Co., IL), was Sophronia Ford, (b. Jul. 7, 1824 Henry Co., KY- d. Jul. 28, 1846), buried in the Ford Cemetery, Crawford Co., IL.. 
2 CONT
2 CONT His 2nd wife, (md. Feb. 28,1850), was Catherine Allison, (b. Aug. 9, 1831 Crawford Co., IL - d. Feb.7, 1893 Bond Twp., Lawrence Co., IL), buried in the Otterbein Cemetery, Lawrence Co., IL. 
2 CONT
2 CONT contributor: Notehogh@comcast.net Inscription: "We All Must Die"
2 CONT
