1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Anna was the daughter of Benjamin Meshe who immigrated from Ireland. He had a land patent from the Penns in Rapho Township north of Manheim. The name was sometimes spelled Meshey.
2 CONT
2 CONT Anna married Stephan Wenger. Her sister Elizabeth married Stephan's brother Christian.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was the mother of the following known children:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1-Christian Meshe Wenger (1756-1841) married Esther Burkholder  2-Henry Wenger (1758-1823) WF no children 3-Stephan Meshe (1763-Sept 9 1823) married Maria Brandt 4-Ann Wenger (Sept 19 1765) married Peter Fuchs/Fox
2 CONT
2 CONT She and her husband Stephan were buried on the Stephan Wenger Farm in Manheim.
2 CONT
2 CONT Her stone reads "AL HIRR ANNA W M RIN IST AL 61 IAHR SML 2 SF 1787" according to Daniel Wenger. 
