1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Susannah Brubacher, "eldest daughter of John and Catharine (Sherk) Brubacher, was born June 28th, 1819. In 1839 she was married to John Weber. They resided about one and half miles west of Breslau for many years, t
2 CONC hen, when old, they moved to Bridgeport where they both died. She died May 21st, 1891. To them was born one child named Veronica. - Eby, Ezra E. A Biographical History of Waterloo Township and Other Townships of the County. 1895.
