1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Benjamin Brubacher "was born April 24th, 1841. In 1867 he was married to Barbara, daughter of John and Mary (Wenger) Meyer. She was born May 12th 1849. After their marriage they moved two miles west of St. Jacobs .
2 CONC .. . Here they resided until his death [due to typhoid fever] which took place January 23rd, 1871. To them were born two sons, namely: Albert, who resides in Elkhart, Indiana [and later in Orange County, California}, and Josephus 
2 CONC who resides at Caledonia, Michigan [and later in Orange County, California]." - Eby, Ezra. A Biographical History of Waterloo Township and Other Townships of the County. 1895.
