1 NOTE {geni:about_me} OBITUARY :
2 CONT MRS. MARY S. GEIST died Thursday of complications at the home of her daughter, Mrs. Emma Minnick, Greencastle. She was aged 72 years, seven months and 24 days and was a member of Reiff's Mennonite church.
2 CONT She was the daughter of the late Daniel Lesher and was the last of her family.
2 CONT She is survived by three children, John L., Hagerstown; Samuel, Maugansville, and Mrs. Minnick, with whom she made her home.
2 CONT The funeral will be held Saturday afternoon, leaving the home at 1:30, services and interment at Reiff's Mennonite church.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source : The Record Herald Newspaper - Waynesboro, Franklin Co., Pennsylvania - Friday, May 23, 1924* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/78219611/mary_s-geist Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/Sm
