1 NOTE {geni:about_me} JOHN S. LESHER, State Line, died at the Washington County Hospital yesterday morning of an abscess of the throat, aged 65 years.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was a member of Trinity U.B. Church, State Line.
2 CONT
2 CONT He is survived by his wife, Mrs. Fannie Lesher; one brother, David; and two sisters, Mrs. Elizabeth Riess and Mrs. Mary Geist, both of Maugansville.
2 CONT
2 CONT Funeral services were held at the home of Mrs. Lesher's sister, Mrs. Samuel Strong, W. Washington Street.  Interment in Rose Hill Cemetery.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: Morning Herald (Hagerstown, MD)
2 CONT Monday, May 6, 1918
