1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Jacob Kauffman Beidler, son of John Beidler and Anna K. Kauffman (1804-1837). Married in 1856 to Elizabeth Beistline. Father to five children.
2 CONT  1. Susanna E. (1859-1938) married Harry K. Shughart. 
2 CONT 2. Madora Dora S. (1861-1931) married George M. Wetzel. 
2 CONT  3. Anna Manda - Amanda ? (1868-1948) married 1st. Rev. Charles E. Wagner and 2nd to Rev. Samuel G. Nickey. 
2 CONT 4. Jacob Michael Beidler (1871-1937) married to Mary Eliz. Shaner. 
2 CONT 5. John B. Beidler [1857-1924].
2 CONT
2 CONT Jacob was survived by brother, John K. Beidler of Oakville, formerly of Carlisle and sister's, Mrs. Levi Snyder and Mrs. John Diller of Carlisle and Mrs. Joseph Brandt, of Holly.* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/99
