2 CONT 1 Barston H. Yoter ( 1873-1886).
2 CONT
2 CONT  Susanna married again on November 13, 1888 to John B. Diller a Cumberland County boy who went out to Nebraska who's first wife Catherine died out there. After Susan and John B. Diller married in Carlisle they went out to Nebraska
