2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Oliver Burkholder was married first to Leah Hershey.  Leah died less than a week after giving birth to twin boys.  Both twins died at birth and are buried with Leah at Fishburn Cemetery in Hershey, PA.  He then married Susan Hersh
2 CONC ey with whom he had 3 sons and a daughter.  Abraham, Felix, Henry and Anna were born in South Annville Township near Campbelltown, PA.  Oliver and Susan are buried in Gravel Hill Cemetery, Palmyra, PA.
