1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 74 yrs 10 mos 29 days
2 CONT
2 CONT Joseph Rotz was the eighth child of Philip Rotz and his wife Fanny.  He was born December 27, 1817 in Lurgan Township and died December 26, 1892 in St Thomas Township at the age of 74 years.  Joseph was married twice, his first wi
2 CONC fe Catherine Peffley and son Jacob died tragically on July 8, 1865 by being struck by lightning.
2 CONT
2 CONT Joseph married Catherine on May 3, 1838.  She was born on March 18, 1816 and died at the age of 49 years.  She was the daughter of David Piffley, Jr. (born about 1788, died 1818) and her mother is unknown.  Catherine is also the s
2 CONC ister of Mary Peffley who married Joseph's older brother Curtis Rotz.  Ten children were born of this marriage.  Both Joseph and Catherine Peffley Rotz are buried at the St. Thomas United Brethren Graveyard.
2 CONT
2 CONT Joseph married second Fanny Veronica Brechbiel on December 24, 1867.  She was born March 2, 1838 in Franklin County, Pa. and is the daughter of John Brechbiel and Anna Meckley.  After the death of Joseph Rotz, she moved to Morrill
2 CONC , Kansas in the year 1893.  She died February 4, 1917 at the age of 78 years, 11 months and 2 days and is buried at the Pleasant Hill Cemetery near Hamlin, Kansas.  Joseh and Fanny Brechbiel Rotz had five children.
2 CONT * Updated from [http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&amp;GRid=134591731 Find A Grave Memorial] via son [http://www.geni.com/profile-34675322224 Samuel Rotz] by [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: 
