1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/17795263/earl-eugene-nichols Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Nov 28 2023, 3:00:45 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT ==notes==
2 CONT ===obituary===
2 CONT From ''Henry County Local'', May 25, 2011:
2 CONT
2 CONT >Earl E. Nichols, 93, of Smithfield, died Tuesday, May 17, 2011 in Louisville at Robley Rex Veterans Administration.  He was the son of the late John C. Nichols, Sr. and Flossie Dickens Nichols.  He was a U. S. Veteran of WWII.
2 CONT >
2 CONT >He is survived by two daughters: Martha Linville, Bellefontaine, OH and Barbara Wright, Enon, OH; and one son: Earl E. Nicholas, Jr., Smithfield.
2 CONT >
2 CONT >Cremation was chosen by the family.  A memorial service will take place at a later date in Jamestown, OH.  Ransdell Funeral Home was in charge of arrangements.
