1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Ann Gregg was born about 1670 in County Kings, Ireland and died about 1729 in New Castle County, Delaware. She married William Dixon about 1690, son of Henry and Rose Dixon. After her husbands death, she married Jo
2 CONC hn Houghton about 1710 in New Castle County, Delaware. She had children by each husband,eight with William and three girls with John Houghton.
2 CONT
2 CONT Often proposed as the Ann, maiden name unknown, who married Swithin Chandler. Not supported by the Dixon or Gregg family websites.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Other Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT William b. 1699
2 CONT
2 CONT Dinah b. 1701
2 CONT
2 CONT John b. 1702
2 CONT
2 CONT Ann b. 1704
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas b. 1705
2 CONT
2 CONT George b. 1706
2 CONT
2 CONT Then married John Houghton and had 9 more kids.
