2 CONT from http://www.heritagepursuit.com/OpDyck/OpDyck2DGen.htm :
2 CONT
2 CONT This John "the Dane" Larison, Sr. ?
2 CONT
2 CONT 1680, Feb. 3. Johanes Loroson testifies in a suit at Newtown between Dr. John Greenfield and the widow Roelofson: "Johanes Loroson aged 29 yers or therabouts, being sworne in Court that dockter Greenfield and https://www.geni.com/
2 CONC people/Gershom-Moore/4286695454430046287 came to the hous of John Desent and the sd Greenfield did in the pr'sents of this deponent speek to the Counstable to summons the widow Roullson to Court, whereupon the Counstable sd that h
2 CONC e would send for the widdow that they may agree without going to Court. Soe she came, and after some word betweene them the sd dockter sd if slice would give him a kis he would aquit her of what was betwene them; and she did soe, 
2 CONC and give each other the hand upon it and further saith not"... (Newt. Ct. R., 112.)
2 CONT
