1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT William Maple married "Kesiah Larrison, ca. 1773, dau. of George and Abigail (Moone) Lar­rison, gr.dau. of Dr. Jacob and Anne Moone of Rocky Hill, Somerset Co., NJ, and gr. dau. of William Larrison of New Brunswick, Middlesex Co. 
2 CONC NJ, g.gr.dau. of John Larrison; b. after 1742 and before 1760, prob. c. 1750, NJ; d. after Feb. 24, 1787, Greene Co, PA."[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.	? Larrison (William Larrison2, John 'The Dane' Larison1).
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of ? Larrison are:
2 CONT *+	2	  i.	George Larrison was born BET 1740 AND 1750 in NJ.
2 CONT *+	3	  ii.	Rachel Larrison was born ABT 1750, and died 1837.
2 CONT * 	4	  iii.	John Larrison was born 1762. He married ? Stewart, daughter of Ezekiel B Stewart and Rachel Larrison. She was born ABT 1774.
2 CONT
2 CONT Same as https://www.geni.com/people/Abigail-Larrison/6000000083284743861?through=6000000023161340862 ?
