2 CONT
2 CONT Page: 647
2 CONT
2 CONT Evidence that the wife of James was Anne Vauquellen, daughter of Robert Vauquellin and Jeane (unknown) seems to be based on the fact that James Bollen signed as witness to the will of Robert Vauquellin. 
2 CONT
