2 CONC ers included James Bollen. James then settled in northeastern New Jersey, under British rule (since Sept. 1664) of this part of New Netherland as it was in dispute for the next decade until full Dutch capitulation in 1674. No doub
2 CONC t Mary came with her parents on that same ship.
2 CONT
