2 CONT * '''Residence''': MONMOUTH, LONG ISLAND, NY, New York, United States
2 CONT ** Reference: [https://www.myheritage.com/research/record-1-330153-2-506452/richard-stout-sr-in-myheritage-family-trees?indId=externalindividual-1e91b58a13afb2543a10d25bc6ef4032&mrid=3d34b345599fb7bb0211d26f2fb99ee1 MyHeritage Fam
2 CONC ily Trees] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Sep 12 2018, 11:51:48 UTC''
