2 CONT (c1622 - 1732) 
2 CONT
2 CONT (Personal note: From the various stories and information I have read there are differences of opinion on Penelope's date of birth, if her last name Pricness is "Princess or Van Princes" and I see in the bottom note on this page th
2 CONC is author puts her marriage date at 1622. Inspite of this confusion, the fact remains that Penelope did exist, she did suffer the Indian attack and survived and she lived to the old age of 110. Her life played a huge inpact in Ear
2 CONC ly American History being the emmigrant ancestor of many. I find her story very interesting.)
