2 CONC Middletown, Monmouth, NJ.  5. iii.   JAMES STOUT, b. 1648, Gravesend, Long Island, NY; d. Aft. 1714, Amwell twp, Hunterdon Co., NJ.  6. iv.   MARY STOUT, b. 1650, Gravesend, Long Island, NY.  7. v.   ALICE STOUT, b. 1652, Middleto
2 CONC wn, Monmouth Co., NJ.  8. vi.   PETER STOUT, b. 1654, Gravesend, Kings County, NY; d. 14 Apr 1704, Middletown, Monmouth County, NJ.  9. vii.   SARAH ELIZABETH STOUT, b. 1656, Gravesend, LI, NY; d. 29 Dec 1714, Woodbridge, Middlese
