2 CONC  b. 1669, Middletown, Monmouth, NJ; d. 1734, Georges Creek, Delaware.  Birth:  1622 Amsterdam Noord-Holland, Netherlands  Death:  1732 Middletown Monmouth County New Jersey, USA 
