1 NOTE Her name may have been Alse. p 3 has a child Joseph, but don't know from which husband.  It said Joseph unmarried.  Dr John E Stillwell, who wrote an early history of the Stouts, was a grandson of Alice.
1 NOTE See Historical Document.
