2 CONT ↑ Somerset Historical Quarterly, A. Van Doren Honeyman, Ed., 1914, Vol III, "The Brunson (Brinson - Bryson) Family, William H Benedict, page 289 https://play.google.com/books/reader?id=vxFJAQAAMAAJ&printsec=frontcover&output=reade
2 CONC r&hl=en&pg=GBS.PA289
