2 CONT 10 COL. JOSEPH STOUT, son of Jonathan Stout, 9, was born Oct. 25, 1686, and died Oct. 22, 1766. He married Ruth.  Issue:
2 CONT
2 CONT 23 Mary Stout; married Harmon Rosenkranz. She had issue: Alexander, Joseph, John, Catharine, Mary and Rachel.
