2 CONT TIMOTHY SMITH, b. November 20, 1730 Hopewell Township, Hunterdon (Mercer) County, NJ , d. February 19, 1796 Hopewell Township, Hunterdon (Mercer) County, NJ (Hunterdon County, NJ will devised March 3, 1787, proven March 11, 1796; 
