2 CONT
2 CONT - Sarah Hunt was born circa 1738. She married Thomas Bryan. She married Rev. John Gano in 1792. 
2 CONT
2 CONT - Jonathan Hunt was born circa 1738. He married Rachel Hampton on 7 Aug 1769. 
2 CONT
2 CONT - Andrew Hunt was born circa 1740. He married Lucy Giles on 27 Sep 1764 at Rowan, North Carolina. 
2 CONT
2 CONT - Charles Hunt was born in 1742 at Hopewell, Hunterdon, New Jersey. He married Francina Smith circa 1765. 
2 CONT
2 CONT - John Hunt was born on 19 Sep 1748. He married Margaret Wilson in 1774. 
2 CONT
2 CONT - Wilson Hunt was born on 16 Jan 1754. He married _____ Burns, daughter of Jacob Burns. He married _____ Bryan. He married Margaret Shotwel, daughter of Jasper Shotwell and Clara Line, in 1793.  (mclaire1999@yahoo.com is descended
2 CONC  from Wilson)
2 CONT
2 CONT - Levi Hunt (twin) was born on 12 Mar 1757. He married Rachel Dean on 11 Dec 1784. He died on 14 Jul 1830 at age 73. 
2 CONT
2 CONT - Agnes Hunt (twin) was born on 12 Mar 1757. She died on 27 Oct 1782 at age 25. 
