2 CONT
2 CONT MARY SMITH was born on September 14, 1720, in Hopewell, Hunderdon County, New Jersey, the daughter of Andrew and Sarah (Stout) Smith. In about 1737 Mary married JONATHAN HUNT in Hopewell, New Jersey. Mary and Jonathan had eight ch
2 CONC ildren, including twins Levi and Agnes, born on March 12, 1757 along the Yadkin River in Rowan County, North Carolina. Mary apparently died from complications from childbirth as she died on March 23, 1757, eleven days after the bi
2 CONC rth of the twins.
