2 CONT ==Spouse==
2 CONT *Jonathon Jacocks
2 CONT ==Note==::Jonathan Jacocks (b. 1714) and Mary Stout (b.c1718) were well acquainted with George Washington and George introduced their daughter, Tabith, to Enoch Pearson (who was one of George's surveying students.)  She married En
2 CONC och and raised 11 children.  After Enoch died, his sister Elizabeth (b.Feb 8, 1726) had just died also (d.1775-1780).  Tabitha married Elizabeth's widower John Townsend (b.c1722) on Jan 19, 1799
2 CONT
