2 CONT * Pioneers of Old Hopewell, Ralph Ege, 1908, page 72 https://archive.org/stream/pioneersoldhope00egegoog#page/n83/mode/1up/search/andrew+smith 
2 CONT *Historical and genealogical miscellany, John E Stillwell, 1916, page 335 http://archive.org/stream/historicalgeneal04stil#page/335/mode/1up/search/mary+lee 
2 CONT *History of the Stout Family, Nathan Stout, 1823, page 8 http://files.usgwarchives.net/nj/monmouth/history/family/stout01.txt In the three sources used for this family none of them name Anna Barbara b. 1735 d. 1772 (SC) m. _______
2 CONC ___Weaver as a child.
