2 CONC  1867-1883, D. Whipple, Jr. 1867-1883, T. M. Weeks 1879-1900, E. P. Hart 1885-, C. E. Olney 1900-1901, M. J. Weeks 1900-, John Ronk 1901-
2 CONT
2 CONT LIST OF TRUSTEES
2 CONT
2 CONT Samuel Noyes, Amasa Cobb, Jesse Stout, N. T. Murdock, John Benedict, Amos Hart, Samuel Crittenden, Ithamer Whipple, Richard Francis, Joseph Hill, Solomon Reynolds, James Mineah, C. D. Hart, A. L. Jones, Furnam Stout, Patterson Fra
2 CONC ncis, Oliver Nye, Chanuncey Bennett, David Whipple Jr., Thomas Darby, Ambrose Hill, Albert Benedict, J. B. Stout, Semon D. Ronk, Edwin Stout, J. B. Hart, Dudley Andrews, Theodore Smith, Nathan Darby, T. M. Weeks, B. F. Robertson, 
2 CONC James Whipple, F. H. Benedict, John A. Ronk, J. F. Dayton, Allen Howard, C. E. Olney, George Gillen, Smith Steadman.
2 CONT
2 CONT CHURCH CLERKS
2 CONT
2 CONT David Whipple, Sr., 1824-31,  Chas. D. Hart 1831-38, Daniel Burton 1838-40, Chas D. Hart, 1840-52, David Whipple, Jr. 1852-77, Nathan Darley 1877-81, E. P. Hart, 1881-
2 CONT
2 CONT SUNDAY SCHOOL SUPERINTENDENTS
2 CONT
2 CONT It is not certain that they came in the order here given. 
