2 CONT Alternate Birth date: 25 April 1756; 
2 CONT
2 CONT *****Oaths of Allegiance, Pension Application and (Most) Tax Records spell his surname CRAFFORD. I have adapted that spelling because his father and his children/grandchildren used that spelling besides him.*****
2 CONT
2 CONT *****The initial "H" is found only on his headstone. Florence Cemetery, located at Crossroads, originally King's Creek.*****
