2 CONC t Will and Testament of Rebecca Crafford Deceased and being ~ Duly sworn on the holy Evangelists of Almighty God did depose and say that they were presentand did see and here the said Testator subscribe her mark Expres’d to be the
2 CONC  mark of Rebaca Crafford seal and publish and declare the same and as for her last Will and Testament and that at the doing there of the said Testator was of sound mind memory and understanding to the best of their knowledge and B
