2 CONT
2 CONT Alfred Alexander STOUT was born on 13 Aug 1835 in Indiana. He died on 15 Aug 1878 in Livingston Co., Missouri. He was buried in Clear Creek Cemetery, Daviess, Missouri. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents: William STOUT and Louisa.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Mary Elizabeth OFFIELD. Alfred Alexander STOUT and Mary Elizabeth OFFIELD were married on 22 May 1856 in Livingston Co., Missouri. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children were: Louisa Maria STOUT, William A. STOUT, John Andrew STOUT, Mary F. STOUT.
2 CONT
2 CONT From: Green Hills Pioneers
