1 NOTE Found in 1870 Census of Marrs Hill Twp, Washington County, AR.  Age 2.  Living in Household of William Watts.
2 CONT
2 CONT Found in 1880 Census of Round Prairie Twp, Benton County, AR.  Age 7 (error - should be age 12).  Living in Household of William Watts.  Sibling initials for 1880 census match those found in 1870 census, thus leading to the conclu
2 CONC sion these are the same families. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Found in 1900 Census of Wilbur Twp, Lincoln County, Washington.  Age 31.  States he was born in Missouri.  His parents are listed as being born in Tennesse(dad) & Illinois(mom).  His wife Minnie is listed as age 21 and born in TX.
2 CONC   Her parents are listed as being born in Arkansas(dad) & Texas(mom). Children in household are: Elisha, male, age 2 - Russell, male, age 1.  Census states Minnie was born Aug 1878, but her death cert states she was born Aug 1879.
2 CONT
2 CONT Found in 1910 Census Record of Spokane, Washington.  Age 41.  Married to Minnie L age 31.  Elsie L listed as age 2.  Jonathan's birthplace listed as Arkansas (contrary to 1900 census).  Minnie's birthplace listed as Texas.  Jonath
2 CONC an's mother (Celia) is listed as being born in Illinois.
2 CONT
2 CONT Found in 1920 Census of Watova Twp, Nowata County, Oklahoma.  Age 51.  Married to Minnie L, age 40.  Elsie L listed as age 10.  Minnie's parents listed as born in United States, state not specified.  All children except William li
2 CONC sted as being born in Washington.
2 CONT
