2 CONT Indiana Bloomington The Herald-Times 1957 Jan 15 Page 10 
2 CONT Mrs. Brosman Dies At Home In Ellettsville 
2 CONT 3em>Mrs. Ella Jane Brosman, 77, died this morning at her home on Oak Street in Ellettsville.
2 CONT 3em>She was the wife of Alvin Brosman, and a member of the Assembly of God Church at Ellettsville.  
2 CONT 3em>Other survivors are nine sons, Byrd Brosman, Unionville Route 1; Levi Brosman, Columbus, Ind.; Aden Brosman, Bloomington; Bernard and Don Brosman, both of Dionvideo,can Andy and Ira Brosman, Brosman both of Phoenix, Arizona an
2 CONC d Virgil Brosman, Henderson, Nebraska; 36 grandchildren and 35 great grandchildren. 
2 CONT 3em>The body remains at the Day Funeral Home where funeral services are being completed and where friends may call..
