1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Daughter of Jacob B & Adelia Sparger Burg Hostetter
2 CONT
2 CONT Til moved with her family by covered wagon around 1865 when she was about a year old, settling at Old Memory near New Market, Taylor, IA then later moved just across the line in Missouri.
2 CONT
2 CONT Til married Isaac Samuel (Sam Pike) Davison on 27 Mar 1881.
2 CONT
2 CONT Til and Sam Pike homesteaded in Alberta, Canada for several years during the early 1900s, but all their children were born in Page County, IA.
2 CONT
2 CONT They are both buried in Braddyville Cemetery
