1 NAME Mary /BUZZARD/
2 GIVN Mary
2 SURN BUZZARD
2 _MARNM Burch
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1843
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1932
1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=24811946
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary E Buzzard was born in Stark Co OH, the daughter of farmer, John Buzzard, and his wife, Elizabeth Rudy.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sometime between 1850 and 1854 the family moved to Greene Co, IN. Mary's mother, Elizabeth, died there on 20 Jul 1854, when Mary was 10.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary married Charles T. A. Burch on 28 Apr 1859. Mary was 15 yrs old and her husband Charles was 17. Charles was a farmer in Greene and Monroe Counties, IN. They were married for 50 years and had no children. Charles passed away 2
2 CONC 3 Nov 1909 at the age of 68.
2 CONT
2 CONT For a few years after Charles death Mary lived with the Susan (Storm) Burch family in Monroe Co., IN.
2 CONT
2 CONT Then when she was 71 years old she married again. She married Joel Manson Burch on 16 Nov 1914. She and Joel were married another 15 years before they passed away at the ages of 89 and 88.
