1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT ===Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT John Harris was a Virginia colonist.John was born about 1657 in York, Virginia. He married Mary Stanley about 1683 in Hanover Virginia. John passed away about 1733 in King William, Virginia.
2 CONT
2 CONT John Harris was one of the founders of the Cedar Creek Society of Friends of Hanover County. In 1904 a forest fire destroyed the Cedar Creek Meeting House. The Cedar Creek Meeting was established in 1721, and laid down in about 18
2 CONC 74.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Stanley-986
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Stanley was born about 1657 in King William, King William Virginia.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary married John Harris (born in Yorkhampton, York, Virginia on 3 Oct 1657, died in King William about ~1733), son of Robert Harris and Mary Elizabeth Claiborne, in 1700 in Hanover, Hanover. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Their children were:
2 CONT
2 CONT #     Elizabeth (Harris) Elmore (~1700 - ~1782) 
2 CONT #     Stanley Harris (~1703 - ~1785) 
2 CONT #     Judith (Harris) Rea (~1705 - ~1756) 
2 CONT #     Daniel Harris (1705 - 1747).  
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary passed away about May 1746 in King William Virginia. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Origins
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Robert Harris and Mary are:
2 CONT
2 CONT * 46 i. Mary8 Harris.
2 CONT * 47 ii. John Harris, born 1662.
2 CONT * 48 iii. Thomas Harris, born 1667.
2 CONT * 49 iv. Claiborne "Ned" Harris, born Abt. 1668.
2 CONT * + 50 v. William Capt. Harris, born 1669 in Broomfield, Essex, England; died 08 Mar 1705/06 in Cedar Hill, Hanover Co., Virginia.
2 CONT * 51 vi. Robert Jr. Harris, born Abt. 1675 in Hanover, Co., Virginia.
2 CONT * 52 vii. Benjamin Harris, born 1677.
2 CONT * 53 viii. Judith Harris, born 1681.
2 CONT * 54 ix. Edward Harris, born 17 Apr 1690.
2 CONT
