1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Not a known husband of https://www.geni.com/people/Lee-Harris/6000000003692412959?through=6000000027897438919
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Harris-1889
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Robert Harris, Jr'''., was born about 1664 at “The Forks,” New Kent County, Virginia, and died on January 10, 1722 at St Martins parish,  Hanover County  at age 57-58.  He is seen as the son of Robert Harris, Sr., of “the Forks
2 CONC ”  and his wife Mary. 
2 CONT
2 CONT St Peter's Parish records show that marriage of Robert Harris & Elizabeth Turner, October 1699.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Robert Harris II and Elizabeth Turner are:
2 CONT # +Robert Harris III, b. 1710, Bertie Co., VA, d. 1786, Granville Co., NC. Robert Harris, brother of Sherwood and Richard m. ___ Lemender Smith/Smythe.
2 CONT # +Sherwood Harris, b., Granville Co. NC, d. 1763.  Married Jane Hudspeth.
2 CONT # +Richard Harris said to be born Jan. 21, 1699 d. 1787.  Married Margaret Kimbrough.
2 CONT # David Harris, named as father “of my niece Mary Harris” in the 1786 Will of Robert Harris.  
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Origins
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Robert Harris and Mary are seen as:
2 CONT
