1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Thomas Harris, son of Robert Harris, is reported to have married Mary Giles.  He settled on Cubb Creek in Hanover County, Virginia.
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas bought some land from his brother William on Bull Swamp.
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas was killed by Indians in 1725.
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas had 7 children.
2 CONT
2 CONT # William Harris (b. 1696 - d. 1778)
2 CONT # Thomas Jr. (b. 1698 - d. 1784)
2 CONT # David (b. 1700)
2 CONT # George (b. 1703)
2 CONT # John (b. 1705)
2 CONT # Stephen (b. 1708)
2 CONT # '''Claiborn''' (b. 1725 - d. 1810)
2 CONT
2 CONT *Some researchers list Richard Harris as the father of Claiborn Harris, but more documentation is needed to to verify this.  As of now the dates don't match up.  What we do know is that genetically Claiborn Harris is a descendant 
2 CONC of Robert Harris, most likely a grandson.  The son of Robert that connects him to Claiborn is important for sure, but not paramount to me at this point.  The DNA is there.  When the facts become clear, a final determination will b
2 CONC e made.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ===Common errors to avoid
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Harris-1896
2 CONT
2 CONT "Their son, '''Thomas''' Harris, married Mary (Giles) Harris and had, among others, a son, Claiborne Harris, called "Ned". Many have tried to "change" the diary statements to make Mary Giles' husband, ''William'' Harris, of the Ca
2 CONC pt. Thomas Harris line, but the original author of the diary, Thomas Harris, son of Thomas Harris and Mary Giles, knew who his own parents were." 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Descendancy
2 CONT * 1 Thomas Harris: B: 1667. D: 1725 + Mary Giles: B: Abt 1667. D: 1757 
2 CONT **         2 Stephen Harris: B: Abt 1685.  
2 CONT **         2 John Harris: B: Abt 1688.  
2 CONT **        2 George Harris: B: Abt 1690.  
2 CONT **         2 David Harris: B: Abt 1692.  
2 CONT **         2 Claiborne "Ned" Harris: B: Abt 1695.  
2 CONT ***                 3 Benjamin Harris: B: Bef 1726. D: Bef 1810                      + Judith : B: Bef 1726.  
2 CONT **         2 Elizabeth Harris: B: 14 May 1707.   + Charles Toney: B: Abt 1707.  
2 CONT ***                 3 Unity Toney: B: Abt 1730.  
2 CONT **        2 Thomas Harris: B: 1712. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
