3 CTRY British Colonial America
1 DEAT
2 DATE 18 JUN 1759
2 ADDR
3 STAE Province of Virginia
3 CTRY British Colonial America
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.multiwords.de/genealogy/Ov10%20William%20Overton..html
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT William Overton and Mary Elizabeth Waters had children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.  Ov9-2 William Overton, their son, born August 14, 1675 d 18 June 1759, married Margaret Garland, dau of Edward Garland and Mary Jane Jennings [sic - Edward Garland had no known daughters] in Louisa Co Va..http://www.e-familytr
2 CONC ee.net/f7530.htm#f53114 shows the sister Mary Garland as the the wife. 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCE:  http://familytreemaker.genealogy.com/users/y/a/g/Douglas-G-Yager/WEBSITE-0001/UHP-0348.html]
2 CONT
2 CONT William Overton (b. December 03, 1638, d. 1697) William Overton was born December 03, 1638 in Easington, Yorkshire, England, and died 1697 in Jamestown, James City, Virginia. He married Mary Elizabeth Waters on November 24, 1670 i
2 CONC n Yorktown, York River, York, Virginia.
2 CONT
2 CONT Includes NotesNotes for William Overton: William married Mary Elizabeth Waters 24 Nov 1670 in St. Peters Parish, New Kent, Virginia. She is the daughter of Samuel Waters and Ann ?. He owned 4,600 acres on the south side of Pumunky
2 CONC  River on Falling Creek in New Kent County, Virginia (Now Hanover County), and also owned 837 acres above main fork, next to J. Norwood and A. Clare tracts in St. Peter's Parish, New Kent County, Virginia.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Willilam Overton and Mary Waters are:
2 CONT
2 CONT *-Mary Elizabeth Overton married Robert Anderson II . -William Overton, born 14 Aug 1675 in New Kent County, Virginia, and died 1737 in Lunenberg County, Virginia.
2 CONT * Temperance Overton, born 16 Mar 1678/79 in New Kent County, Virginia, and died in Hanover County, Virginia. She married William Harris 1696 in Hanover County, Virginia. 
2 CONT * Samuel Overton, born 14 Aug 1685 in New Kent County, Virginia. He married Elizabeth Carr.
2 CONT * James Overton, born 14 Aug 1688 in New Kent County, Virginia, and died 18 Jun 1749 in Hanover County, Virginia. He married Elizabeth Trueheart Garland.
2 CONT
2 CONT His father, Col Overton, is said to have commanded a brigade of Iron Sides under Oliver Cromwell and commanded a brigade of Iron Sides and one wing of the army at the Battle of Dunbar. For some reason he was placed in the Tower of
2 CONC  London and died there. William's aunt was Mary Overton, who married Richard II Anderson. William's grandparents were Mary's parents. So William's grandson, James Anderson, third great-grandparents were John Overton and Joane Snaw
2 CONC sell.
2 CONT
2 CONT More About William Overton: Burial: New Kent County, Virginia. Record Change: February 10, 2004
2 CONT
2 CONT More About William Overton and Mary Elizabeth Waters: Marriage: November 24, 1670, Yorktown, York River, York, Virginia.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of William Overton and Mary Elizabeth Waters are:
2 CONT
2 CONT *    +Elizabeth Mary Overton, b. June 26, 1673, Yorktown, York River, York, Virginia, d. 1734, St Peters Parish, New Kent County, Virginia.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Origins
2 CONT
2 CONT The eight children of William Overton and Elizabeth Waters, born at New Kent County, Virginia Colony, were:
2 CONT
2 CONT # Elizabeth b 28-6-1673-1735, m. Captain Robert Anderson
2 CONT # William 1675-d 18 Jun 1759; m. Margaret "Peggy" Garland.
2 CONT # Temperance b. 1678/79, New Kent, VA, d 19 Feb 1716, Hanover, VA. She md Capt. William Claiborne Harris abt 1695, son of Maj. Robert Harris and Elizabeth (Mary) Claiborne.
2 CONT # Margaret Overton, 1680-1704. no spouse
2 CONT # Samuel b: 14 AUG 1685 d 1759 Hanover, VA; m. Anne Carr 1710, Hanover, VA
2 CONT # James, Captain, b: 14 AUG 1688 in St. Martin's Parish, Hanover County, Virginia d 18 Jun 1749, Louisa, VA; md Elizabeth Garland.
2 CONT # Truhart Overton, 1689 - bef 1725. m. Elizabeth
2 CONT # Barbara b: 05 FEB 1690 -1766, m. William Winston
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
