1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Daughter of William Overton and his wife, Elizabeth Waters
2 CONT
2 CONT She is the third wife of William Winston- and her name appears on this marker- but there is no evidence she is buried here. Many believe she is buried at "Beaverdam" see link:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GSln=winston&GSmid=46847797&GRid=31270990&
2 CONT
2 CONT She had two sons with William Winston- John and James Winston, they are named in their mother Barbara O. Winston's will.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT
