1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Biographical Summary===
2 CONT William Harris (1724–1792) was a colonial-era Virginian planter and landowner primarily associated with the historical settlements of Hanover, Louisa, and Goochland counties. Born into a well-established Virginia family, he spent 
2 CONC his adulthood managing tobacco acreage and expanding family holdings. He married Henrietta Baker in 1748.
2 CONT
2 CONT As a veteran who registered for early regional military service in 1754, William spent most of his life in the Virginia Piedmont. In his later years, he participated in the early westward expansion movements following the American
2 CONC  Revolutionary War. He tragically died in May 1792 at the age of 68 when he drowned in a flatboat accident on the Ohio River while moving west toward Kentucky. His descendants spread south into the North Carolina Piedmont and west
2 CONC  into Indiana and Kentucky.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Vital Statistics===
2 CONT Identity & Lifespan
2 CONT Full Name: William Harris, III
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth Date: 1724
2 CONT Birth Place: Hanover County, Colony of Virginia, British Colonial America
2 CONT
2 CONT Death Date: May 8, 1792
2 CONT Death Place: Ohio River (near the Kentucky border territory)
2 CONT Age at Death: 68 years old
2 CONT Burial Place: Unmarked / Lost at river crossing
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Parentage===
2 CONT -Father: William Harris, Jr. (1700–1764), a colonial landowner of Virginia.
2 CONT -Mother: Elizabeth Burnett (1710–1795).
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Spouses===
2 CONT Wife: Henrietta Baker (born c. 1728). (Note: Some regional trees record her maiden name or middle lineage alternatively as Henrietta Nuckolls or Henrietta Ann Burnett).
2 CONT Marriage Date: 1748.
2 CONT Marriage Place: Hanover County, Colony of Virginia.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Children===
2 CONT William and Henrietta Harris were the parents of at least 9 children (6 sons and 3 daughters). Their profiles, recorded chronologically, include:
2 CONT 1. Mary "Polly" Harris
2 CONT Lifespan: February 10, 1749 – 1819.
2 CONT Locations: Born in Goochland County, VA; died in Randolph County, NC.
2 CONT Basics: Married Augustine Davenport, Sr. in 1767; mother of Jesse Davenport.
2 CONT 2. Moses Harris
2 CONT Lifespan: c. 1751 – 1812.
2 CONT Locations: Born in Louisa County, Virginia.
2 CONT Basics: Tracked through early Virginia agricultural land registries.
2 CONT 3. William Harris IV
2 CONT Lifespan: Born c. 1753.
2 CONT Locations: Born in Louisa County, Virginia.
2 CONT 5. Jesse Harris, Sr.
2 CONT Lifespan: c. 1755 – 1823.
2 CONT Locations: Born in Virginia; migrated to Rowan/Davidson County, North Carolina.
2 CONT Basics: Pioneered the North Carolina property trades alongside his sister Mary.
2 CONT 6. John Harris
2 CONT Lifespan: Born c. 1758.
2 CONT Locations: Born in Louisa County, Virginia.
2 CONT 7. Henrietta Harris
2 CONT Lifespan: Born c. 1760.
2 CONT Locations: Born in Virginia.
2 CONT 8. Robert Harris
2 CONT Lifespan: Born c. 1763.
2 CONT Locations: Born in Virginia.
2 CONT 9. Nancy Harris
2 CONT Lifespan: Born c. 1766.
2 CONT Locations: Born in Virginia.
2 CONT 10. Overton Harris
2 CONT Lifespan: Born c. 1770.
2 CONT Locations: Born in Virginia; named after the prominent ancestral Overton family line.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Factual Documentation===
2 CONT Colonial Military Enlistment Logs: Tracks his 1754 entry into regional military service within colonial Virginia defense alignments.
2 CONT
2 CONT Louisa and Hanover County Deed Registries: Identifies land allocations, transfers, and inheritance parameters tying him to his parents and children.
2 CONT
2 CONT Westward Pioneer Emigration Logs: Journals and probate mentions from 1792 chronicle his river-transit casualty on the Ohio River during the post-Revolutionary frontier push.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Sources===
2 CONT Ancestral metadata and detailed parentage timelines are cataloged via FamilySearch - William Harris Profile (LD3Z-CB1).Collaborative records detailing his family branch and his 1792 river accident are archived on WikiTree - Willia
2 CONC m Harris Profile (Harris-15940).
