2 CONT
2 CONT Nancy B Warren Waite BIRTH	30 Nov DEATH	5 Dec 1838 BURIAL	 Center Church Cemetery Shelbyville, Bedford County, Tennessee, USA  MEMORIAL ID	15611971 · View Source
2 CONT
2 CONT Consort of George Waite.
2 CONT
2 CONT George Waite b. abt. 1797 in North Carolina m. Nancy B. Warren b. 20 Nov 1796 in North Carolina d. 12 May 1838 in Bedford County, Tennessee Married: Wft Est. 1810-1832 in Bedford County, Tennessee
2 CONT
2 CONT George is buried in Manchester tn, he is listed in the 1850 census for coffee county, tn. the information seems to fit circumstantially. there is no other record of a George Waite b. about 1795-1797 other than the above census not
2 CONC ed and this tree that i have found to date living in the area. there is one with a George Waite b. about 1800 listed in a warren household in bedford county as a border, (1820 census) enumerated as being from nc as well, i believe
2 CONC  them to be the same person.
2 CONT
2 CONT Family Members Spouse Photo	 George Waite 1790–1857
2 CONT
2 CONT Children Photo	 Warren Starnes Waite 1827–1896
