1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Elizabeth Ann Pritchett (Waller)'''
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/66853790/elizabeth-ann-pritchett
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Waller, daughter of John Waller, was born in Virginia. About 1782, she married James Pritchett. To this union ten children were born:
2 CONT
2 CONT * William Pritchett, born 7 March 1783
2 CONT * Wealthy Pritchett , born about 1789
2 CONT * Nancy Pritchett, born about 1792
2 CONT * Benjamin Pritchett, born 1794
2 CONT * Waller Pritchett, born 26 December 1795
2 CONT * Mary Ann B. Pritchett, born about 1799
2 CONT * Addison Pritchett, born May 1800
2 CONT * Agnes Carr Pritchett, born 1802
2 CONT * Horace Pritchett, born 20 June 1804
2 CONT * Robert Pritchett, born 1808
2 CONT ∼
2 CONT Pritchett - Ingles Reunion, "The Daily Review"(Decatur, Illinois) July 6, 1897. This address was delivered by Judge Thomas Alexander Pritchett, at a Pritchett - Ingles Family Reunion held in Niantic, Illinois on 5 July 1897. Judge
2 CONC  Thomas A. Pritchett was the son of William Pritchett and Lydia G. (Wilson) Pritchett.
2 CONT --
2 CONT Moved to Hopkins Co Ky with brother James and her children after husband's death. 
