1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Ann Woodson Harris''' was born on October 19, 1767, in Goochland, Virginia, USA, Goochland County, VA, United States and was baptized on December 13, 1767, in St James Northam Parish, Goochland County, Virginia, United States. 
2 CONC Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-100522948 Nathaniel Lancaster, I] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-76261695 Hope Lancaster (Walker)]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Ann married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34768194111 Capt. Robert Harris] on December 7, 1789, in Greenville, Augusta, Virginia, United States. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-34768194113 J
2 CONC ohn Proctor Harris, Sr]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Ann married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34744170286 William Woodson] on November 29, 1792, in Prince Edward County, Virginia, USA, Prince Edward County, VA, United States. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on February 11, 1811, in Farmville, Prince Edward, Virginia, USA, Buckingham County, Virginia, United States. 
