1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''John Proctor Harris, Sr''' was born in 1801 in Prince Edward County, Virginia, USA. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34768194111 Robert Harris Capt] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34723479222 Ann Woodson Harris
2 CONC ]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT John married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34768197095 Elizabeth Richardson] in 1820. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34768197109 Robert D Harris];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34768197111 Silas Randolph Harris];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34768197110 Malinda Harris]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT John married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34768197094 Amelia Mildred Millie Harris] in 1835 in Tennesee, USA. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34768197099 Robert D Harris];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34768197098 Silas Randolph Harris];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34768197101 James Harris];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34768197102 Minerva Harris];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34768197100 Nancy Ann Harris];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34768197103 John Proctor Harris, Jr];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34768197104 Lucinda Harris];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34768197106 Joseph Joe Camp Harris];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34768197105 Alfred Gilbert Harris];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34768197107 Abraham Davis Harris];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34768197108 Naomi Tennessee Cricket Harris]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in 1885 in Crawford, Missouri, United States. 
