1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Mary & Joseph were married on 8 Aug 1796 in Pulaski County, Kentucky.  Joseph Roy is listed in the 1810, 1820, 1830 and 1840 Federal Census.  Their children are: Joshua 1799-1861 md Sarah Hall ( children), Lemuel 1
2 CONC 802 md Eleanor Wilson, Asa 1803, Joseph Jr 1808, md Lucy Hainey (1 child documented, may be others), Enos 1810-1860 md Nancy Wilson (5 known children), Jemima 1812-1897 md Dr Shadrack Williams Stephens (1 known child), and Zachari
2 CONC ah 1812-1898 md Elizabeth Wilson (15 children).* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/139471355/mary-roy Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''May 27 2022, 5:43:26 UTC''
2 CONT
