2 CONT Hensley was the son of Chrisopher and Elizabeth Grubbs Harris of Albemarle County VA. Hensley was born in Madison County KY of Irish and Welsh extraction. Hensley moved to Logan County, now Simpson, in 1816, and March 10, 1831 he 
2 CONC married Malinda J. Vineyard of Simpson County, they had the following children: Elizabeth Frances {Duncan}, Mourning T.{Morton}, Mary E.{Lauck}, Joseph B, Hattie H.{(Dickey),deceased by 1886}, William C.{deceased by 1886}, John G.
2 CONC , Hensley G.{killed by guerrillas} Amanda E.{McQuidy}, Jesse V, and Katie K. 
2 CONT
