1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Margaret Maupin was born on Moorman's River in Albemarle County, VA, in 1767 and died at the home of her son-in-law, Col. James Miller, in Lincoln County, KY, in 1855. She was buried on the farm of her son, Major W
2 CONC illiam Harris, in Madison County, KY. On 14 Apr- 1785, she married John Harris.
2 CONT
2 CONT The story of Margaret Maupin and John Harris is well recorded in "Histories and Genealogies", pg. 304-306, by William Harris Miller.
