1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Bernard Maupin, son of Cornelius and Mourning Harris Maupin, b. 1 Jun 1783 in Albemarle Co. VA, d. 11 Feb 1861, in Montgomery Co. MO. He is buried there on the farm of his son Charles and his wife Virginia Harris. 
