1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Rebecca and William Jameson with their five children left Albemarle Co. VA, for Missouri about 1835. They came first to Fem Osage, then to St. Charles, MO. We know they came with other family members, Rebecca's bro
2 CONC ther Charles Wesley Maupin had come earlier to this area. It is said that Rebecca rode horseback all the way from Virginia to Missouri.
