2 CONT [p.199] Mrs. Mary Miller Stephens.
2 CONT DAR ID Number: 14532
2 CONT Born in Kentucky.
2 CONT Wife of Charles Stephens.
2 CONT Descendant of Capt. Archibald Woods, of Virginia.
2 CONT Daughter of Gen. John Miller and Elizabeth Jones Goodloe, his wife.
2 CONT Granddaughter of William Goodloe and Susannah Woods, his wife.
2 CONT Gr.-granddaughter of Archibald Woods and Mourning Harris Shelton, his wife.
2 CONT Archibald Woods, (1749-1836), served in the Virginia militia until the surrender at Yorktown. He was born in Albemarle county, Va., and was a pensioner from Madison county, Ky., where he died.
2 CONT Also No. 4077.
