1 NOTE {geni:about_me} A Patriot of the American Revolution for NORTH CAROLINA with the rank of STAFF OFFICER.  [http://services.dar.org/Public/DAR_Research/search_adb/?action=full&p_id=A001858  DAR  Ancestor #: A001858] 
2 CONT
2 CONT Member of the Virginia Convention of 1788 and the Kentucky Convention of 1799; He was one of three sons and five daughters of William Allin and his second wife, Frances Grant Allin; He married Mary Jouett in Mercer County, Kentuck
2 CONC y, on February 13, 1789; They had eight sons and two daughters; Originally buried on his farm, his remains were later re-interred in Spring Hill Cemetery. 
2 CONT
