1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''John Cosby Dickerson, Sr.''' was born on January 22, 1772 in Albemarle County, Virginia, USA, New York, United States. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34627956965 Thomas S. Dickerson] and [https://www.geni.com/pr
2 CONC ofile-34765984590 Mildred Crosthwait]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT John married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34673439128 Elizabeth Dickerson] on December 19, 1790 in Albemarle, Virginia, United States, Albemarle County, Virginia, United States. Together they had the following children: [https://
2 CONC www.geni.com/profile-34753892098 George Washington Dickerson]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34736932026 Robert Nathaniel Dickerson]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34627956920 Rachel Turner]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34753892
2 CONC 103 Mildred &quot;Millie&quot; Hubert]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34673438669 Charlotte Stovall]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34685356959 John Cosby Dickerson, Jr]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-123032445 Eleanor Wright]; [h
2 CONC ttps://www.geni.com/profile-34736932021 Kinchen Dickerson]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34753892104 Walter Waller Dickerson]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34753892100 David Martin Dickerson]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-24643
2 CONC 767293 James Dansan Dickerson]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34765799711 William Leroy Dickerson]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34753892105 Wilson Dickerson]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34753892106 Richardson Marion Dickerson
2 CONC ]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in 1830 in Castilian Springs, Sumner, Tennessee, United States. 
