1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''George Washington Dickerson''' was born in 1791 in Albemarle, Virginia, United States. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34736514240 John Cosby Dickerson, Sr.] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34673439128 Elizabet
2 CONC h Dickerson]. He was a Farmer . 
2 CONT
2 CONT George married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34765959349 Winny Turner] on August 2, 1816 in Sumner, Tennessee, USA. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on August 2, 1816 in Sumner County, Tennessee, USA and was buried after August 2, 1816 there. 
