1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Mildred &quot;Millie&quot; Hubert''' was born on November 12, 1796 in Albemarle County, Virginia, USA. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34736514240 John Cosby Dickerson, Sr.] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-3467
2 CONC 3439128 Elizabeth Dickerson]. She was a Housewife. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mildred married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34649817329 David Hubert] on November 5, 1816 in Sumner County, Tennessee, United States. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-34649816848 Mary Pauli
2 CONC na Hudson]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766002364 Frances M. Crockett]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766002358 Charlotte Hubbert]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766002361 Narcissa Hubert Norrid]; [https://www.geni.com/pro
2 CONC file-34766002357 Matilda Hubbert]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766002355 Evaline Hubert]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766002360 Esther Hubert A Reeves]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766002362 Charles Wesley Hubert]; [ht
2 CONC tps://www.geni.com/profile-34766002363 Pleasant Cumming]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766002365 Thomas Jefferson Hubert- Hubbard]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766002366 Adeline Mae Hubert / Caldwell]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on December 28, 1882 in Obion, Obion, Tennessee, United States and was buried after December 28, 1882 there. 
2 CONT ----
