1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Charlotte Stovall''' was born in 1799 in Albemarle County, Virginia, United States. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34736514240 John Cosby Dickerson, Sr.] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34673439128 Elizabeth D
2 CONC ickerson]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Charlotte married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34673438675 Byard Stovall] on July 5, 1816. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766141387 Jane Catherine Stovall Padgett]; [https://www.geni.com
2 CONC /profile-34766141389 Bartholomew W. Stovall]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766141388 Jane Catherine Stovall]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766141386 Robert Dickerson Stovall]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766141390 Thomas
2 CONC  M Stovall]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766141391 Mary A Hailey]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34673438532 Henry Clay Stovall]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766141394 Preston Stovall]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-347661
2 CONC 41393 Noah Stovall]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766141395 George Martin Stovall]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in 1846 in Sumner, Tennessee, USA. 
2 CONT ----
