1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''John Cosby Dickerson, Jr''' was born in 1800 in Albemarle County, Virginia, USA. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34736514240 John Cosby Dickerson, Sr.] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34673439128 Elizabeth Dick
2 CONC erson]. He was a Farmer . 
2 CONT
2 CONT John married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34765857923 Mary Leatha Dickerson] on October 6, 1823 in Sumner, Tennessee, USA. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-34765857926 Elizabeth Dickerson]; 
2 CONC [https://www.geni.com/profile-34765857928 John William Dickerson]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34765857925 John Cosby Dickerson, III]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34765857930 Frances Jane Douglass]; [https://www.geni.com/profi
2 CONC le-34765857927 George Washington Dickerson]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34765857929 Wilson Dickerson]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in 1885 in Benton County, Missouri, USA  and was buried in 1885 in Douglas - Wiseman Cemetary. 
2 CONT ----
