1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Walter Waller Dickerson''' was born in 1806 in Albemarle, Virginia, United States. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34736514240 John Cosby Dickerson, Sr.] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34673439128 Elizabeth Di
2 CONC ckerson]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Walter married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766194303 Mildred] on January 9, 1828 in Sumner County, Tennessee, USA. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766194305 Emanida Dickerson]; [https:
2 CONC //www.geni.com/profile-34766194311 Elizabeth A. Dickerson]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766194307 Nancy W. Dickerson]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766194310 Jackson Dickerson]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766194308 Mat
2 CONC ilda Dickerson]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766194309 Dorrett Dickerson]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766194312 Minerva Frances Dickerson]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766194313 Louisa Dickerson]; [https://www.geni.co
2 CONC m/profile-34766194314 Amelia Caroline Dickenson]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766194315 Henry Clay Dickerson]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766194316 Daniel Webster Dickerson]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in August 1859 in Locust Bayou, Calhoun, Arkansas, United States and was buried after August 1859 in Bearden, Ouachita County, Arkansas, United States of America. 
2 CONT ----
