1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''David Martin Dickerson''' was born on July 10, 1807 in Albemarle County, Virginia, USA. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34736514240 John Cosby Dickerson, Sr.] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34673439128 Elizabe
2 CONC th Dickerson]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT David married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766198079 Elisabeth A Bentley] on July 3, 1830 in Sumner,Tennessee. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766198083 William Hubbard Dickerson]; [htt
2 CONC ps://www.geni.com/profile-34766198085 Margaret Dickerson]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766198082 James Dickerson]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766198081 John Dickerson]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766198084 Eliza Dick
2 CONC erson]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766198086 David Dickerson]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766198088 Minnie Dickerson]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766198089 George Dickerson]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on January 8, 1876 in Benton County, Missouri, USA. 
2 CONT ----
