1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Richardson Marion Dickerson''' was born on July 17, 1809 in Albemarle, Virginia, USA. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34736514240 John Cosby Dickerson, Sr.] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34673439128 Elizabeth
2 CONC  Dickerson]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Richardson married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766210361 Matilda W. Dickerson] on February 20, 1833 in Sumner, Tennessee. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766210373 Minerva Sumner Doak]
2 CONC ; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766210374 Brunetta C Hill]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766210375 Norvel Monroe Dickerson]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766210377 James Wilson Dickerson]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-347
2 CONC 66210376 John Cosby Dickerson]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766210381 Henry Clinton Dickerson]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766210388 Albert G. Dickerson]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766210390 Robert Winfield Dickerso
2 CONC n]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766210391 Elizabeth Seneth Cunningham]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766210392 Fountain Pitts Dickerson]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766210393 Bishop Henerette Dickerson]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on January 8, 1876 in Benton, Missouri, United States and was buried after January 8, 1876 in Walker-Wright Cemetery, Cross Timbers, Hickory County, Missouri, USA. 
2 CONT ----
