1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Pvt. James Dansan Dickerson''' was born circa 1810 in Bartow, Jefferson, Georgia, United States. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34736514240 John Cosby Dickerson, Sr.] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-3467343912
2 CONC 8 Elizabeth Dickerson]. He was a Farmer and Texas Ranger. 
2 CONT
2 CONT James married [https://www.geni.com/profile-24643920293 Elizabeth Ann Dickerson] on August 25, 1828 in Thomasville, Thomas Co., GA, Thomas, Georgia. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-347365006
2 CONC 74 Albert (Elbert) Dickerson]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34736500797 Mary Elizabeth &quot;Polly&quot; Rawls]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-24643398293 Catherine Ann &quot;Katy&quot; Dickerson]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-3
2 CONC 4736500712 Elizabeth Ann McCartney]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34736632640 John Cullen &quot;Cull&quot; Dickerson]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34736500936 Pvt. (CSA) , William Alexander &quot;Alec&quot; Dickerson]; [https:/
2 CONC /www.geni.com/profile-34705681574 Pvt. (CSA) , Joseph Richard &quot;Joe Dick&quot; Dickerson]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34765754630 Martha Dickerson]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on September 23, 1853 in Shawnee Prairie, Angelina, Texas from Ambushed and killed by Indians and was buried after September 23, 1853 in Texas, United States. 
2 CONT ----
