1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Wilson Dickerson''' was born in 1805 in Albemarle County, Virginia, USA. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34736514240 John Cosby Dickerson, Sr.] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34673439128 Elizabeth Dickerson]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Wilson married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766183172 Margary Hubbard] circa 1840 in Missouri. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766183179 Crosby Dickenson]; [https://www.geni.com/profile
2 CONC -34766183181 David Hubbard Dickenson]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Wilson married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766183173 Marjorie Cunningham] on September 8, 1828 in Obion Co., Tennessee. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766183175 Richerson Dickenson]; 
2 CONC [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766183174 Mansfield Dickenson]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766183176 Sarah Dickenson]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766183177 William Dickerson]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766183178 Mi
2 CONC ldred Dickenson]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in Obion, Obion, Tennessee, USA or California.
2 CONT ----
