1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Arabia Brown, Indian Scout for Daniel Boone, Revolutionary War Patriot is born on this date in Virginia. He was an “Indian Spy” for Boone at Booneboro, was at the siege of the fort by the British and Shawnee in 177
2 CONC 8. He was not an Indian. His job was to spy on Indians. We would call him a scout today. He served a second enlistment and was at Yorktown. 
2 CONT
2 CONT When his son-in-law died in a typhoid epidemic in Kentucky, his daughter’s goods had to be auctioned off to pay the debts of the estate. He bought it all and then gave it back to his daughter, Nancy Brown Spratt. He was quite a ma
2 CONC n. Later, he was a Captain in the state militia fighting against the Shawnee. He died in 1844 at the age of 88. (source: Ky White)
2 CONT --------------------
