1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Jackson was born somewhere between 1842 and 1850, according to the censuses, but our best understanding is just on or before 1850. He shows up on the 1850 (as Mariam - female, 2, unless that's a completely differen
2 CONC t child),1860 (as Jackson, 10) and 1870 (Jackson, says 27, should be 20) censuses. He marries a Mary, and is seen at the end of the Pleasant Sublett record in the 1870 census.
2 CONT
