1 NOTE {geni:about_me} In the 1915 Harrison County Iowa census, there is a Geo W. Sublet, age 64, b. MO, father b.KY, mother b. TN (matches our data), married, working as a teamster. Owns his home/farm, valued $1500. NO church affiliatio
2 CONC n (interesting!) Four years of schooling. Can read and write, 40 years in IA (if we read that rightly)
2 CONT
