1 CONT Spouse: Elizabeth (--?--)
1 CONT Note: James and Elizabeth lived in Augusta Co.,VA (later Botetourt). James was a veteran of the Revolutionary War, drafted 17 Feb 1778 for a term of one year. He was a private in Captain Winston's Company of the 14 Virginia Regime
1 CONC nt of Foot, commanded by Col. William Davies. James was at Valley Forge 3 Jun 1778 and at West Point 1 Oct 1778. The LAWRENCE family owned land at the mouth of Craigs Creek on the north side of the James River before arriving in K
1 CONC Y in the 1770's
