1 CONC ,,Crayford Parish Kent County Mother: Elizabeth Jane (Boteler) BUTLER  b: ABT 1610 in England,,,,,Middlesex Co LondonMarriage 1 Major Robert HARRIS b: ABT 1615 in Wales,,,,,Glamorgan 
