1 CONT John Williams, b. 8 Jan 1792 Caswell Co., NC. Came to Matagorda County, Texas with his brothers in Dec 1823. Listed as one of Austin's "Old Three Hundred". Settled on land in the Cedar Lake area. Never married, will probated 2 May
