1 CONT 1900 Census, Tulare County, California, ED 70, page 33, line 66,
1 CONT Dwelling 281, family 283, 411 Goshen Ave. Visalia:   Isaac T.
1 CONT Bell, head, b. 7mo, 1844, age 55, married 32yrs, all b. Tenn,
1 CONT real estate agent; Elizabeth, wife, b. 1mo, 1851, age 49,
1 CONT married 32 yrs, mother of 5, 4 living, b. Tenn, mother b. N.C;
1 CONT Anna M, dau, b. 3 mo, 1877, age23, single, all b. Tenn, student.
