1 CONT Dwelling 75, 411 Goshen Avenue, Visalia:   Isaac T Bell, heaqd,
1 CONT age 65, married 42 years, father b. Ohio, Lawyer, land office
1 CONT practice; Sarahpna, wife, age 59, married 42 years, mother of 4,
1 CONT 4 living, both parents b. N.C.
